          "distinct": true,
          "id": "10952b7005f2fd4bde42c22fa567dab030f74d2c",
          "message": "feat(client): Prisma.defineExtension (#16515)\n\n* type performance improvements\r\n\r\n* generate narrowable types for query\r\n\r\n* fix exported name of patch flat 3\r\n\r\n* fix $allModels merging priority\r\n\r\n* fix client type merging priority\r\n\r\n* revert experiment with rejectnotfound\r\n\r\n* remove extraneous space\r\n\r\n* restore jsdoc line breaks\r\n\r\n* add query extensions on runtime\r\n\r\n* add type alias for default args\r\n\r\n* add callback types\r\n\r\n* accommodate defineExtension types\r\n\r\n* restore query data arg name\r\n\r\n* Update packages/client/src/generation/TSClient/PrismaClient.ts\r\n\r\n* fix optionality in types\r\n\r\n* fix issues with tx and write tests\r\n\r\n* properly gate query ext and skip test\r\n\r\n* fix bug with transaction re-wrapping\r\n\r\n* generate less types for models\r\n\r\n* reduce query types to a minimum\r\n\r\n* complete tests with type tests and wildcards\r\n\r\n* improve payload inference performance\r\n\r\n* cleanup\r\n\r\n* adapt test for mongo & sqlite\r\n\r\n* improve performance of truthykeys\r\n\r\n* make select include readonly\r\n\r\n* skip data proxy and increase windows heap\r\n\r\n* fix runtime error\r\n\r\n* begin draft for define xtension\r\n\r\n* try lowering windows heap\r\n\r\n* bust flakiness for sqlite\r\n\r\n* increase heap\r\n\r\n* disconnect after each test\r\n\r\n* attempt to skip tests for windows\r\n\r\n* make defineExtension work\r\n\r\n* add tests and fix small type-level issues\r\n\r\n* fix type definition\r\n\r\n* remove export from default-index.js",
          "timestamp": "2022-11-28T20:59:54-10:00",
