          "id": "664942d78012ff3b82859b00a8aca57263fae009",
          "message": "refactor: Select and Include type generation (#17239)\n\n* refactor: Select and Include type generation\r\n\r\nSplit type generation from `Model.ts` and use ts-builders for\r\ngeneration. Adds several helpers, necessary for this refactoring:\r\n`typeDeclaration`, `export` and `keyType`.\r\n\r\n* Address review comments\r\n\r\nIntroduce base class for all type declarations. Move method for wrapping\r\ninto parenthesis there, as well as `subKey` helper.\r\n\r\n* Resolve circular dependency",
