          "distinct": true,
          "id": "5e4322b0441cb16cea0bcfa3877550e4a1fa8ec7",
          "message": "refactor: Abstraction over engine protocol (#17475)\n\n* refactor: Abstraction over engine protocol\r\n\r\nPulls everything GraphQL-related into\r\n`GraphQLProtocolEncoder`/`GraphQLMessage` classes. Intorudces generic\r\ninterfaces around them, so protocol could be later swapped for JSON in\r\nruntime without the need to change `RequestHander`/`PrismaClient` code\r\nthat much.\r\n\r\nBatching unit test, that was heavily dependent on raw GraphQL input got\r\nconverted to functional test that uses only public API.\r\n\r\nClose prisma/client-planning#243",
          "timestamp": "2023-01-24T11:26:06+01:00",
          "tree_id": "614480e336d8b0e079b0758b3423a631059ec686",
