          "id": "fe4442d6deaebc358c3b7d0ef463706d418af486",
          "message": "fix(client): ensure runtime type declaration have no dependencies (#17652)\n\n* fix: ensure runtime type declaration have no dependencies\r\n\r\nWe've accidentyaly exposed NodeFetch types to the runtime, that\r\nintoduced dependency on node-fetch package. That breaks runtime types if\r\nthe module is not installed. Fixed by redeclaring node-fetch types\r\ninstead of reusing them. Also, adds a test to check it won't happen\r\nagain.\r\n\r\n* Update packages/engine-core/src/data-proxy/utils/request.ts\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: pierre <pierreantoine.urvoy@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: pierre <pierreantoine.urvoy@gmail.com>",
