          "message": "feat: add support for Wasm'd getDmmf (#17533)\n\n* feat: add support for Wasm'd getDmmf\r\n\r\n* chore(deps): update engines to 4.10.0-56.integration-get-dmmf-wasm-handle-errors-7e5bb4fceecd0a115f8e99a78b2d1827e58c708f\r\n\r\n* feat(wasm): support parsing validation errors for getDmmf\r\n\r\n* chore: update test snapshots\r\n\r\n* chore: removed redundant code in getDmmf\r\n\r\n* test: fix tests in artificial-panic\r\n\r\n* test: fix tests in incomplete-schemas\r\n\r\n* test: fix tests in getDmmf.test.ts\r\n\r\n* test(client): use getDMMF from @prisma/internals in client tests\r\n\r\n* test(client): use getDMMF from @prisma/internals in other utilities\r\n\r\n* test(client): use getDMMF from @prisma/internals in \"memory\" tests\r\n\r\n* chore(client): revert moving getDMMF in getTestClient\r\n\r\n* feat: remove getDMMF export from @prisma/client\r\n\r\n* test(client): use getDMMF from @prisma/client in non-integration client tests\r\n\r\n* feat(client): removed getDMMF export from generator.ts\r\n\r\n* chore: update pnpm-lock.yaml\r\n\r\n* test: update get-dmmf variant in snapshot\r\n\r\n* chore(deps): update engines to 4.10.0-62.integration-get-dmmf-wasm-handle-errors-b1cab025df75ffc6b890e90611c3a9b9c1f0984c\r\n\r\n* feat: handle getDmmf errors just like getConfig\r\n\r\n* chore: finishing touches\r\n\r\n* chore(deps): update engines to 4.10.0-64.integration-get-dmmf-wasm-handle-errors-3d4278979c9faf9b522074a40a7988576e3018da\r\n\r\n* chore: address PR comments\r\n\r\n* fix: allow reading from datamodel path\r\n\r\n* test(internals): add new getDMMF tests, especially for error cases\r\n\r\n* chore: add missing stripAnsi\r\n\r\n* test(internals): add success case when using getDMMF with datamodelPath\r\n\r\n* chore: maybe fix CI on windows?\r\n\r\n* chore: fix CI on windows\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Prismo <prismabots@gmail.com>",
