          "id": "f4a7eba69d1307b539ecb998bf7d36bca5ae13f3",
          "message": "feat(client): split runtime by the engine and minify it (#17156)\n\n* feat(client): split runtime by the engine\r\n\r\nBuilds separate runtime files for library, binary and data proxy\r\nengines. Generated client will then use corresponding runtime.\r\n\r\nThis decreases the size of library engine runtime by half and data proxy\r\nby 2/3.\r\n\r\nClose prisma/client-planning#202\r\n\r\n* Minify runtime\r\n\r\n* Fix error messages\r\n\r\n* Enable source maps\r\n\r\n* Snapshots\r\n\r\n* More callsite fixes\r\n\r\n* Use source maps in reproductions folder\r\n\r\n* One more snapshot\r\n\r\n* More callsite fixes, skip error test for edge client\r\n\r\n* Another day, another snapshot update\r\n\r\n* Fix Windows callsites\r\n\r\n* Add test for correct runtime",
