          "message": "feat: capture reason for Wasm panics in CLI (#17950)\n\n* chore: bump versions to https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/pull/3711\r\n\r\n* feat(wasm): add globalThis.WASM_PANIC_REGISTRY for capturing the reason and location for Wasm panics in the cli\r\n\r\n* feat(wasm): capture reason for Wasm panics in \"format()\"\r\n\r\n* feat(wasm): capture reason for Wasm panics in \"get_config()\"\r\n\r\n* feat(wasm): capture reason for Wasm panics in \"get_dmmf()\"\r\n\r\n* feat(wasm): capture reason for Wasm panics in \"lint()\"\r\n\r\n* Revert \"chore: bump versions to https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/pull/3711\"\r\n\r\nThis reverts commit 1b8eb11b46abdbdcf269c1e88cc9c55883942376.\r\n\r\n* chore(deps): update engines to 4.11.0-24.integration-capture-wasm-panics-543bfdafb66aa4ce6a35f6056bb4f7588c921df2\r\n\r\n* test(wasm): no more unreachable Wasm panic message\r\n\r\n* Revert \"chore(deps): update engines to 4.11.0-24.integration-capture-wasm-panics-543bfdafb66aa4ce6a35f6056bb4f7588c921df2\"\r\n\r\nThis reverts commit 263ce0411d197af62ade84643e0934d44763e7bc.\r\n\r\n* chore(deps): update engines to 4.11.0-28.cb65d78d04bbb4ee83c2ba4a57c5f0b64689d03c\r\n\r\n* test: update snapshots, normalize Rust code locations\r\n\r\n* chore: fix eslint in type declaration\r\n\r\n* chore: left TODO in wasm.ts\r\n\r\n* chore: replaced private field using \\# with \"private\"\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Prismo <prismabots@gmail.com>",
