          "message": "feat(cli): Views Introspection Warnings (#18000)\n\n* added warnings types\r\n\r\n* added types to union\r\n\r\n* views warning handling\r\n\r\n* added missing warning code 26\r\n\r\n* Updated type -> tpe for code 21\r\n\r\n* test(migrate): test views warning code 21 for postgres\r\n\r\n* test(migrate): fix typo\r\n\r\n* test(migrate): add more tests for views in postgres\r\n\r\n* test(migrate): minor refactoring after trying to centralize before/after Jest hooks\r\n\r\n* test(migrate): add example of re-introspection of postgres warnings in views\r\n\r\n* Added views re-introspection tests for codes 22-26\r\nUpdated test for code 21\r\n\r\n* Updated test for views code 22\r\n\r\n* update: review comments\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Jan Piotrowski <piotrowski+github@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n* Updated snapshots: remove tmp model\r\n\r\n* Extract before / after setup/teardown to helper\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Sergey Tatarintsev <tatarintsev@prisma.io>\r\n\r\n* remove not-null enforcement on setupParams\r\n- not nullable\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Sergey Tatarintsev <tatarintsev@prisma.io>\r\n\r\n* Update test names for 21 to be more specific\r\nRemoved un-necessary introspection tests\r\n- added info comments for context\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Jan Piotrowski <piotrowski+github@gmail.com>\r\n\r\n* removed fixtures for removed tests\r\n\r\n* updated fixtures for code 24\r\n- added 'variant' to specifiy what to test\r\n- new test for multiple code 24 warnings\r\n\r\n* Removed catch for views (re-)introspection setup\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Sergey Tatarintsev <tatarintsev@prisma.io>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <skiabo97@gmail.com>\r\nCo-authored-by: Jan Piotrowski <piotrowski+github@gmail.com>\r\nCo-authored-by: Sergey Tatarintsev <tatarintsev@prisma.io>",
