          "id": "3cec2060abfc5ee380f9f4b82d39cf32413eb0b8",
          "message": "fix(client): Exclude source maps from publishing (#18081)\n\n* fix(client): Exclude source maps from publishing\r\n\r\nThey are not used by default, will not be usefull to the most users and\r\nincrease `@prisma/client` size unnecessary. In the future, we'd build a\r\nseparate package for them so we'll have an option to use them when we\r\nneed it, but for now, we'd just exclude them from npm package.\r\n\r\n* Fix getPackagedPackage\r\n\r\nUse npm-packlist instead of recreating logic ourselves",
