          "id": "25a48e7648a44f5237faa2d9bbe50f0034561dd8",
          "message": "fix(client): Fix TS compilation on TS < 4.7.0, add tests for older TS versions (#20039)\n\n* ci: Test older TS versions\r\n\r\nThis a set of very basic e2e tests that would check that our runtime and\r\ngenerated client at least compile without errors when using older TS\r\nversions. It does not check that generated types actually work - for\r\nthat we'd need to run client functional tests under  different TS\r\nversions. But minimal verification that we are not breaking anything is\r\nstill better than nothing.\r\n\r\n* fix(client): Fix extension types for TS < 4.7.0\r\n\r\nFix #20024\r\n\r\n* Remove lockfiles, add typescript@next",
