          "id": "d0fc7250c15da8660506bb1da904562e339ec3c0",
          "message": "fix(client): statically inject prismaVersion to default-index.js (#20096)\n\nResolving the client and engines version dynamically by reading\r\n`package.json` files in `default-index.js` is not be possible in edge\r\nruntimes like Cloudflare Workers, or might even be potentially problematic\r\nwhen using bundlers with Node.js. We can inject the version statically\r\nat build time instead to avoid the need to figure it out at run time.\r\n\r\nFixes: https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/19972",
