          "message": "feat(migrate): add back `getDatabaseVersion` (#20232)\n\n* feat(internals): ported \"getDatabaseVersion\"'s types to migrateTypes.ts to avoid circular dependencies\r\n\r\n* feat(migrate): add back support for getDatabaseVersion\r\n\r\n* feat(migrate): add support for no arguments for getDatabaseVersion\r\n\r\n* test(schema-engine): update rpc tests for getDatabaseVersion\r\n\r\n* fix(schema-engine): avoid overriding \"getDatabaseVersion()\" when FORCE_PANIC_SCHEMA_ENGINE is set\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Joël Galeran <Jolg42@users.noreply.github.com>",
