          "id": "a24b7771997848d22203600d38d3abdcbed3f053",
          "message": "feat(client): Add shortcut for `by` argument (#20296)\n\n* feat(client): Add shortcut for `by` argument\r\n\r\nThis shortcut exists and works on the engine level, but was not\r\nimplemented on the client. Since 5.0, validation and types allowed to\r\nhave a scalar in `by`, but such messages were not encoded properly.\r\n\r\nFix #20261\r\n\r\n* Add type tests\r\n\r\n* Fix extended client",
