          "distinct": true,
          "id": "78a4e98c6f0d509c1146f67613b5dd10b215c316",
          "message": "refactor: Simplify DMMFHelper, stop (most) DMMF patching (#20848)\n\n* refactor: Simplify DMMFHelper, stop (most) DMMF patching\r\n\r\nThis merges 3 DMMFHelper back into one - since P5 they are used only\r\nwithin generator and we no longer need to split into base/full dmmf for\r\nruntime.\r\nAlso, removes a couple of functions/properties that are not used by the\r\ngenerator and were added for runtime GraphQL validation.\r\nMost notably, removes `resolve*` methods and leaves original DMMF mostly\r\nuntouched. Which means that `field.type.type` property will always be a\r\nstring now and we can remove a bunch of condintion for handing resolved\r\nvalues all over the genrator. For 2 places where we actually need\r\nresolved types, two helper methods for on-demand non-destructive\r\nresolution are added.\r\n\r\n* Simplify generic args info a bit\r\n\r\n* Cache input types resolution\r\n\r\n* Remove unused arg\r\n\r\n* Fix base JSON types\r\n\r\n* Pre-compute type resolutions\r\n\r\n* Rename thing\r\n\r\n* Fix test\r\n\r\n* Fix benchmarks ts compilation\r\n\r\n* Fix failing tests\r\n\r\nFFS, can it be done now please\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Jan Piotrowski <piotrowski+github@gmail.com>",
          "timestamp": "2023-09-05T17:04:02+02:00",
