          "id": "5ab4f9e9c6b6b8a80413eba19fad170f9f83c135",
          "message": "test(client): unskip upsert/native-atomic for libsql adapter (#21697)\n\n* Unskip upsert/native-atomic for libsql adapter\r\n* Fix flaky test dependent on the timing of the logs\r\n\r\n`upsert/native-atomic` test was dependent on the timing of the logs\r\narriving before the assertion is made. This might not necessarily\r\nhappen, and in practice turned out to be flaky on CI with libSQL\r\nadapter. This commit makes the test wait for the logs using the\r\n`waitFor` utility.\r\n\r\nCloses: https://github.com/prisma/team-orm/issues/398\r\nCo-authored-by: pierre <pierreantoine.urvoy@gmail.com>",
