          "id": "80ede26cdcbd4e930ec02700e4f79adb65dcf05a",
          "message": "fix(client): Fix itx forwarding and add missing tests (#21691)\n\n* fix(client): Fix itx forwarding and add missing tests\r\n\r\nBefore, we postponed some of the tests for future: error forwarding for\r\nadapter and validation error if adapter is used in binary engine. This\r\nPR adds missing tests and fixes couple of things they uncovered:\r\n\r\n- error forwarding was not working correctly for interactive\r\n  transactions.\r\n\r\n- validation error for adapter in binary engine happened a little bit\r\n  too late and did not follow our usual conventions for constructor\r\n  options validation.\r\n\r\nClose prisma/team-orm#363\r\n\r\n* Update packages/client/src/runtime/core/engines/library/LibraryEngine.ts\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Alexey Orlenko <alex@aqrln.net>\r\n\r\n* Address feedback\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Alexey Orlenko <alex@aqrln.net>",
