          "id": "a0c1b24fd410d0ef063a40a632a7102031dd95f9",
          "message": "test(client): enable tracing tests with all driver adapters (#21811)\n\n* Un-skip tracing tests for libSQL/Turso and PlanetScale driver\r\n  adapters.\r\n\r\n* Adapt the test expectations to support synthetic BEGIN and COMMIT\r\n  spans produced for driver adapters that manage transactions using\r\n  high-level APIs provided by third-party JavaScript drivers and don't\r\n  emit normal query spans for BEGIN and COMMIT because those statements\r\n  are not executed by Prisma itself.\r\n\r\n* Update the `deleteMany` test to support `relationMode = \"prisma\"` as\r\n  it is used with PlanetScale.\r\n\r\nCloses: https://github.com/prisma/team-orm/issues/505",
