          "message": "test(client): add \"chunking-query\" test suite, differentiating Driver Adapters from plain Rust drivers (#21679)\n\n* test(client): add \"too many bind variables\" test, distinguishing Driver Adapters from plain Rust drivers\r\n\r\n* chore: exclude PlanetScale\r\n\r\n* chore: replace createMany in sqlite\r\n\r\n* chore: run create concurrently on sqlite\r\n\r\n* test(driver-adapters): update tests after investigation\r\n\r\n* test: add chunking query test suite\r\n\r\n* test: remove test suites for issue 8832 and 9326, as they are integrated into the new chunking-query test suite\r\n\r\n* chore: update link to issue\r\n\r\n* chore: remove comments\r\n\r\n* fix(test): race condition\r\n\r\n* chore: skip data proxy\r\n\r\n* chore: group helper functions, add new describe blocks\r\n\r\n* fix: remove quotes in raw query that was causing mysql to return 0 rows\r\n\r\n* chore: add different case for mysql\r\n\r\n* chore: don't exclude data proxy and mini proxy\r\n\r\n* chore: don't exlude cockroachdb\r\n\r\n* chore: refactor comments, removing outdated ones\r\n\r\n* chore: PR suggestions",
