          "id": "d4f2f3be1704286292bb727f0e4f38930e1c4fc6",
          "message": "fix: Add proper export maps for ESM packages (#21962)\n\n* fix: Add proper export maps for ESM packages\r\n\r\nAdapter packages included `module` entires for bundlers, but not\r\n`exports` for unbundled node.js code. Therefore, in that context\r\nadapters were always treated as common.js, which means that they might\r\nnot always be compatible with ESM drivers.\r\n\r\nBuild process for the adapter packages was adjusted to emit separate\r\ndeclaration file for ESM files. This is a TS 4.7+ requirement.\r\n\r\nFix #21956\r\n\r\n* Fix debug import\r\n\r\n* Another attempt",
          "timestamp": "2023-11-15T15:10:06+01:00",
