          "id": "551986bc5c4900eaf3d71f2725b327ccef7154e1",
          "message": "chore: bundle vendors in internal packages (#22017)\n\n* chore: bundle vendors\r\n\r\n* update locks\r\n\r\n* fix tsc plugin to only include dev into bundle\r\n\r\n* fix local postinstall\r\n\r\n* contribute to smaller cli bundles\r\n\r\n* migrate: make prompts lib external\r\n\r\n* leave generator helper to be fully bundled\r\n\r\n* update locks\r\n\r\n* mark prompts external in internals too\r\n\r\n* mark arg external in internals\r\n\r\n* don't bundle debug for generator-helper\r\n\r\n* simplify e2e run.ts to include all\r\n\r\n* update lockfile\r\n\r\n* fix e2e\r\n\r\n* add missing tmp dest\r\n\r\n* fix paths in e2e\r\n\r\n* fix missing slash in name\r\n\r\n* unskip tests\r\n\r\n* mark packages external\r\n\r\n* apply review comments\r\n\r\n* make engines-version to be bundled in client\r\n\r\n* update lock\r\n\r\n* fix publish script\r\n\r\n* ensure proper tree-shaking\r\n\r\n* update snap\r\n\r\n* respect external packages in path resolution\r\n\r\n* simplify and document changes to tscPlugin",
