          "id": "40ad141dacc2773d6caec2222dec38acd1da8e06",
          "message": "test(client): Test diffierent moduleResolution options in TS (#22795)\n\n* test(client): Test diffierent moduleResolution options in TS\r\n\r\nFor new driver DX, if your TS is misconfigured, client class will be\r\nmarked as deprecated. This PR adds tests for different combinations of\r\n`module`/`moduleResolution` options and ensures that client is marked as\r\ndeprecated when we want it and is not when we don't.\r\n\r\nFix prisma/team-orm#854\r\n\r\n* Address review comments",
