          "id": "65b96d3fcf09bf039501f2c11d7fc41cd835f1a6",
          "message": "feat(client): Use split WASM engine (#22957)\n\n* Implement split\r\n\r\n* Fix non-wasm import\r\n\r\n* Fix things\r\n\r\n* Don't try to copy wasm files for unsupported providers\r\n\r\n* Copied provider has no suffix\r\n\r\n* Fix runtime-import test\r\n\r\n* Fix multiple loadings\r\n\r\n* Fix no-engine e2e test\r\n\r\n* Try to fix failing ecosystem tests\r\n\r\n- Support `postgres` provider alias\r\n- Convert `_bg` files to common.js\r\n\r\n* Bundle-size: create provider-specific bundles\r\n\r\n* Address some of the feedback\r\n\r\n* Address the rest of feedback\r\n\r\nDon't copy wasm-bindgen runtime files with `--no-engine`\r\n\r\n* Fix --no-engine test in runtime\r\n\r\n* Apply fill plugin to wasm_bg\r\n\r\n* Fix --no-engine deleteion\r\n\r\n* Require runtime early\r\n\r\n* Use filler for function too\r\n\r\n* Bump engines to latest version",
