          "distinct": true,
          "id": "89dda02d14fa00116d85d840cd43a5e13b2368a3",
          "message": "test: Fix jest snapshot drifts (#23735)\n\n* test: Fix jest snapshot drifts\r\n\r\nOur custom serializer returned string as-is. This confused the hell out\r\nof jest's indentation detection algorithm and caused the drift of the\r\nsnapshots on every update we all know and love.\r\nDefault snapshot serializer wraps strings in quotes and I do the same\r\nfor this PR. This seems to fix the drift, for the price of having to\r\nupdate every single inline snapshot we have.\r\n\r\n* More updates\r\n\r\n* Fix cli\r\n\r\n* Another pack of snapshots updated\r\n\r\n* Binary engine snapshots\r\n\r\n* Binary CLI\r\n\r\n* And generator test\r\n\r\n* Another day, another batch of snapshot updates\r\n\r\n* Another batch, definetely not all\r\n\r\n* And another one\r\n\r\n* And more\r\n\r\n* Yet another batch\r\n\r\n* I hope it is the last one",
          "timestamp": "2024-04-05T12:41:43+02:00",
