          "message": "fix(client): Fix `globalOmit` with methods that do not return the model (#24765)\n\nFor a bunch of methods that do not do selections on models, we still\r\nincluded omitted fields, despite them not existing on output type. That\r\nbroke query engine-side validation and produced very confusing error.\r\n\r\nFixed by explicitly excluding those methods from `globalOmit` handling.\r\n\r\nClose #24716",
