          "id": "b58adc8fdee1b6b438350ea6de34c8cc83ba4807",
          "message": "fix(client): Correctly resolve `configDir` when `prismaSchemaFolder` is used (#24826)\n\n* fix(client): Correctly resolve `configDir` when `prismaSchemaFolder` is used\r\n\r\nConfiguration directory is used for resolving relative SQLite and SSL\r\ncertificates paths in QE. After #24609, we correctly changed it in all\r\nof the CLI commands, but not in generated client. Therefore, if\r\n`prismaSchemaFolder` was used, client could not find the DB or SSL\r\ncertifcate, created by migrate command.\r\n\r\nFix #24647\r\nFix #24779\r\n\r\n* Restore fallback to schemaPath\r\n\r\n* fix test\r\n\r\n* Fix more",
          "timestamp": "2024-07-22T15:28:47+02:00",
          "tree_id": "1fa3b558320b24cd2873cd9ac33a173725bf775f",
