          "id": "72f3ff669459d70985ef7c493bb4292946850577",
          "message": "feat(config): introduce `prisma.config.ts` support (#26271)\n\n* feat(config): create \"@prisma/config\" package\r\n\r\n* feat: update prisma.config.ts\r\n\r\n* feat: move types around\r\n\r\n* feat(config): add tests for defineConfig\r\n\r\n* feat(config): force \"experimental: true\"\r\n\r\n* test(config): add tests for loadConfigFromFile\r\n\r\n* feat(cli): add example support of \"prisma.config.ts\" in \"prisma validate\"\r\n\r\n* chore: get rid of changes in adapter-*\r\n\r\n* feat(config): improve loadConfigFromFile, support multiple kinds of errors, expand tests\r\n\r\n* feat(cli): update usage of \"@prisma/config\" in \"prisma validate\"\r\n\r\n* feat(config): allow env loading without explicit loadEnv function\r\n\r\n* fix(prisma config): remove console.log\r\n\r\n* docu(prisma config): adjust docu comments\r\n\r\n* fix: ignore intentional syntax error from prettier\r\n\r\n* fix(config): fix e2e tests by re-arranging \"esbuild-register/dist/node\"'s import\r\n\r\n* chore(config): fix prettier\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>\r\nCo-authored-by: Florian Goessler <florian.goessler@hey.com>",
