          "id": "34995bd5bbbce1484ba43ad362479eeeb62b56fc",
          "message": "fix(client-engine): `unique` node does not imply `required` (#26305)\n\nThe way it's designed on the query compiler side, `unique` must check\nthat we have no more than one element and `required` must check that we\nhave at least one element. A composition of `unique` and `required` must\nbe used in the query plan if we need to ensure that we have exactly one\nelement.",
          "timestamp": "2025-02-11T17:47:04+01:00",
