          "message": "feat(config): locate prisma schemas via `prisma.config.ts` (#26317)\n\n* feat(config): parse Prisma Config's structure for conformance\n\n* feat(config): replace \"experimental\" attribute with \"earlyAccess\"\n\n* feat(config): update \"loadConfigFromFile\" function\n\n* feat(config): import \"PrismaConfig\" as type only\n\n* chore(config): import comment in test\n\n* test(config): fix test snapshot in CLI\n\n* feat(config): add support for \"schema\" attribute to \"defineConfig\"\n\n* chore(schema-files-loader): extracted types previously used in internals\n\n* feat(config): forward configInput.schema to config.schema, adapt tests\n\n* fix(config): minor cosmetic changes to defaultConfig, fixing tests in cli\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
