          "id": "e002705817cbcd98b233c75c069cb3f5440e26a4",
          "message": "feat(prisma-config): ORM-628 use schema path from config file (#26333)\n\nThis PR adjusts all our CLI commands to also respect the configured\nschema path location based on `prisma.config.ts`.\n\nI intentionally left out larger refactorings like hoisting the actual\nschema loading further up. This also meant that for now a bunch of\nslightly inconsistent logic or implicit dependencies about the schema\nloading are still in the codebase. E.g. the \"sneaky\" implicit setting of\nthe `--schema` cmd line arg in\n[checkUnsupportedDataProxyMessage](https://github.com/prisma/prisma/blob/23d8251da96e068ad45d09b2aef3b625f0fc4269/packages/internals/src/cli/checkUnsupportedDataProxy.ts#L54-L57).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alberto Schiabel <jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
