          "id": "220bdde1b623affd9ee6e09ae4802c8c88387031",
          "message": "feat(config): use `prisma.config.ts` without `defineConfig` (#26357)\n\nThis PR:\n- closes\n[ORM-621](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-621/allow-prismaconfigts-to-work-without-importing-prismaconfig)\n- allow defining `prisma.config.ts` without depending on\n`@prisma/config`\n\n\n```typescript\nimport path from 'node:path'\n\nexport default {\n  earlyAccess: true,\n  schema: {\n    kind: 'single',\n    filePath: path.join('..', 'prisma', 'schema.prisma'),\n  },\n}\n```\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
