          "id": "87e8507e167b67fef747e8a532e2e5efebcc0ff3",
          "message": "feat(studio): ORM-578 enable use of driver adapters in prisma studio (#26329)\n\nEnable `prisma studio` to work with driver adapters based on\n`prisma.config.ts`.\n\nRelies on work in Prisma Studio itself to be merged first:\n- https://github.com/prisma/studio-code/pull/596\n- https://github.com/prisma/studio-code/pull/597\n\nExample `prisma.config.ts` file:\n\n```typescript\nimport path from 'node:path'\nimport { defineConfig } from '@prisma/config'\nimport { PrismaLibSQL } from '@prisma/adapter-libsql'\nimport { createClient } from '@libsql/client'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  earlyAccess: true,\n  schema: {\n    kind: 'single',\n    filePath: './prisma/schema.prisma',\n  },\n  studio: {\n    adapter: async (env: unknown) => {\n      const connectionString = `file:./dev.db'\n      const libsql = createClient({\n        url: connectionString,\n      })\n      return new PrismaLibSQL(libsql)\n    },\n  },\n})\n```",
