          "distinct": true,
          "id": "9a4dba77b37e5ebfba0a213bc2593cf4b3ccb600",
          "message": "chore(deps-dev): bump @inquirer/prompts from 5.0.5 to 7.3.2 (#26479)\n\nBumps [@inquirer/prompts](https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js) from\n5.0.5 to 7.3.2.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/releases\"><code>@​inquirer/prompts</code>'s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><code>@​inquirer/prompts</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.3.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mark <code>@types/node</code> as an optional peer dependency across\nall packages.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​inquirer/prompts</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.0.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hoist peer-dependencies to remove warning when using\n<code>yarn</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​inquirer/prompts</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.0.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@types/node</code> is now only a\n<code>peerDependencies</code>. This reduces the install size of inquirer\ndramatically for folks not using Typescript. It's unlikely to break your\nbuilds if you used TS already, if it does run <code>npm install --dev\n@types/node</code>/<code>yarn add --dev @types/node</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​inquirer/prompts</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/6\"><code>@​6</code></a>.0.0</h2>\n<p>No technical breaking changes; but we changed the style of the\nquestion <code>prefix</code> once the answer is provided. Once a\nquestion is answer, the prefix becomes a tick mark (previously it was\nthe same <code>?</code> as when the prompt is idle.)</p>\n<p>This is theme-able, and so can be overwritten to with\n<code>theme.prefix</code>.</p>\n<h2><code>@​inquirer/prompts</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/5\"><code>@​5</code></a>.3.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Now includes a <code>search</code> prompt. <code>import { search }\nfrom @inquirer/prompts</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​inquirer/prompts</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/5\"><code>@​5</code></a>.1.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Now includes a new <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/tree/main/packages/number\"><code>number</code>\nprompt</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​inquirer/prompts</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/5\"><code>@​5</code></a>.0.7</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Replace <code>chalk</code> with <del><code>picolors</code></del> (in\n5.1.0 went to <code>yoctocolors</code> to stay with Sindre's packages\nand reduce amount of provenance.)</li>\n<li>TS 5.5 (no impact expected on package users)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/27c8859a99557790d1f87721e185a5208c8487db\"><code>27c8859</code></a>\nPublish</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/c6ecd420c5ae9b890404928e5d4c305b0490f088\"><code>c6ecd42</code></a>\nChore: Bump dependencies</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/2f94923fbd5dca7d4df24fba027336fdb966d753\"><code>2f94923</code></a>\nChore: Remove Warp sponsorship</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/7ce36cc95f6313c476850ae289bfe4d1ea0be7cd\"><code>7ce36cc</code></a>\nChore(deps-dev): Bump vitest in the npm_and_yarn group (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/issues/1671\">#1671</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/8320f698babb11a9e0878998e9bfc4c7616a1944\"><code>8320f69</code></a>\nChore(deps-dev): Bump <code>@​vitest/coverage-v8</code> from 3.0.4 to\n3.0.5 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/issues/1666\">#1666</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/cadcc37bbb1d85e9f680576162ce6b887e6b523b\"><code>cadcc37</code></a>\nChore(deps-dev): Bump <code>@​types/node</code> from 22.13.0 to 22.13.1\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/issues/1670\">#1670</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/95bd983742fcfb4fbf56f1fedaed117e3b989836\"><code>95bd983</code></a>\nChore(deps-dev): Bump eslint from 9.19.0 to 9.20.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/issues/1669\">#1669</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/fb24d0a1e1452c7198c8f92b61e11b6bfbdb2185\"><code>fb24d0a</code></a>\nChore(deps-dev): Bump typescript-eslint from 8.22.0 to 8.23.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/issues/1668\">#1668</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/979e8dd60f06671a80f0fa20f98a8f5789d8017e\"><code>979e8dd</code></a>\nChore(deps-dev): Bump globby from 14.0.2 to 14.1.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/issues/1667\">#1667</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/commit/b2709b82d621cd553adb26dd1c371cc957ba412e\"><code>b2709b8</code></a>\nPublish</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SBoudrias/Inquirer.js/compare/@inquirer/prompts@5.0.5...@inquirer/prompts@7.3.2\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=@inquirer/prompts&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=5.0.5&new-version=7.3.2)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot merge` will merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot squash and merge` will squash and merge this PR after\nyour CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot cancel merge` will cancel a previously requested merge\nand block automerging\n- `@dependabot reopen` will reopen this PR if it is closed\n- `@dependabot close` will close this PR and stop Dependabot recreating\nit. You can achieve the same result by closing it manually\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
