          "message": "chore(deps-dev): bump cli-truncate from 2.1.0 to 4.0.0 (#26492)\n\nBumps [cli-truncate](https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate) from\n2.1.0 to 4.0.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/releases\">cli-truncate's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v4.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Breaking</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require Node.js 18  f72f8fa</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/compare/v3.1.0...v4.0.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/compare/v3.1.0...v4.0.0</a></p>\n<h2>v3.1.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate#truncationcharacter\"><code>truncationCharacter</code></a>\noption (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/issues/19\">#19</a>)\n23b40dc</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/compare/v3.0.0...v3.1.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/compare/v3.0.0...v3.1.0</a></p>\n<h2>v3.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Breaking</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require Node.js 12.20  38ea95c</li>\n<li>This package is now pure ESM. Please <a\nhref=\"https://gist.github.com/sindresorhus/a39789f98801d908bbc7ff3ecc99d99c\">read\nthis</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/compare/v2.1.0...v3.0.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/compare/v2.1.0...v3.0.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/commit/7080bf23f18ebca5557796711e520feac6fdf05a\"><code>7080bf2</code></a>\n4.0.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/commit/f72f8fac808bd788333f44d2c59ba3848ce5d9d0\"><code>f72f8fa</code></a>\nRequire Node.js 18</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/commit/ad595f2b1a7522e8dd209f05397d993ca6725c1f\"><code>ad595f2</code></a>\n3.1.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/commit/23b40dc576d53f83a88caa2001ce5341d9f3241c\"><code>23b40dc</code></a>\nAdd <code>truncationCharacter</code> option (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/issues/19\">#19</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/commit/42f602d1af13387515c8d6b7f02915c7021c0544\"><code>42f602d</code></a>\n3.0.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/commit/38ea95c293025dde28b829e661a4c1ae60027a9e\"><code>38ea95c</code></a>\nRequire Node.js 12.20 and move to ESM</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/commit/0c2e15226ac1440934636d15babd0630e52256da\"><code>0c2e152</code></a>\nMove to GitHub Actions (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/issues/16\">#16</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/cli-truncate/compare/v2.1.0...v4.0.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=cli-truncate&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=2.1.0&new-version=4.0.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot merge` will merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot squash and merge` will squash and merge this PR after\nyour CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot cancel merge` will cancel a previously requested merge\nand block automerging\n- `@dependabot reopen` will reopen this PR if it is closed\n- `@dependabot close` will close this PR and stop Dependabot recreating\nit. You can achieve the same result by closing it manually\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
