          "id": "ddd5f7b83d8a8614fe9ca0f36da11fcc3c52e0a6",
          "message": "fix(cli): init url showing unnecessary step (#26511)\n\n## Description\n\nWhen both `--datasource-provider` and `--url` are provided together\nduring `prisma init`, an unnecessary step is displayed in the console:\n`1. Set the DATABASE_URL in the .env file to point to your existing\ndatabase. If your database has no tables yet, read\nhttps://pris.ly/d/getting-started`\n\n## Related Issue\n\nFixes: [#9645](https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/9645)",
