//github.com/aryaemami59\"><code>@​aryaemami59</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>11.1.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Added TypeScript support for config (by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aryaemami59\"><code>@​aryaemami59</code></a>).</li>\n<li>Fixed <code>webpack-why</code> regression (by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/hoo00nn\"><code>@​hoo00nn</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>11.0.3</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed <code>.mjs</code> config support (by Arya Emami).</li>\n<li>Updated <code>esbuild</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>11.0.2</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed <code>require is not defined</code> regression.</li>\n<li>Updated <code>esbuild-visualizer</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>11.0.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated <code>estimo</code>.</li>\n<li>Updated <code>lilconfig</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>11.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Moved to Brotli as default compression. Use <code>gzip: true</code>\nfor old behavior.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>10.0.3</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed third-party plugins support (by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/JounQin\"><code>@​JounQin</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/size-limit/commit/896eee2dc167e01a42d69f6bdbd4462ef3d867e7\"><code>896eee2</code></a>\nRelease 11.2.0 version</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/size-limit/commit/69fab9c18f95d6aa45bc8cefdd4ef97f11dd1af0\"><code>69fab9c</code></a>\nUpdate Vitest</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/size-limit/commit/15a4c46949d43fd88e72280bb9113b622732d884\"><code>15a4c46</code></a>\nUpdate dependencies</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/size-limit/commit/edda423227cc51dc8e5eab32d99215629970d64c\"><code>edda423</code></a>\nfeat: add time options to set loading network speed, latency and message\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/ai/size-limit/issues/384\">#384</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ai/size-limit/commit/6f44d9b1e2bac2555d5067e22f7edbe13ee569a1\"><code>6f44d9b</code></a>\nAvoid 