          "message": "chore(deps-dev): bump ora from 5.4.1 to 8.2.0 (#26573)\n\nBumps [ora](https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora) from 5.4.1 to 8.2.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/releases\">ora's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v8.2.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add support for <code>boolean</code> value for <code>color</code>\noption (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/ora/issues/244\">#244</a>)\nfe951e5</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v8.1.1...v8.2.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v8.1.1...v8.2.0</a></p>\n<h2>v8.1.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix animation speed when update methods are called very often\n818ca34</li>\n<li>Fix handling of symbol being empty string in\n<code>stopAndPersist()</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/ora/issues/243\">#243</a>)\n5117dfb</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v8.1.0...v8.1.1\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v8.1.0...v8.1.1</a></p>\n<h2>v8.1.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Update dependencies  fb0fced</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v8.0.1...v8.1.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v8.0.1...v8.1.0</a></p>\n<h2>v8.0.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the process not exiting  89a1f31</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v8.0.0...v8.0.1\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v8.0.0...v8.0.1</a></p>\n<h2>v8.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Breaking</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require Node.js 18  675590f</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Update dependencies 675590f</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v7.0.1...v8.0.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v7.0.1...v8.0.0</a></p>\n<h2>v7.0.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix missing dependency (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/ora/issues/228\">#228</a>)\n1dc1ece</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v7.0.0...v7.0.1\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v7.0.0...v7.0.1</a></p>\n<h2>v7.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Breaking</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require Node.js 16  0e96acd</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v6.3.1...v7.0.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v6.3.1...v7.0.0</a></p>\n<h2>v6.3.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix Node.js 12 compatibility  4b1c2be</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v6.3.0...v6.3.1\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v6.3.0...v6.3.1</a></p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/79d0339e000cf956ba5581013f27bd86a41d56fc\"><code>79d0339</code></a>\n8.2.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/fe951e57c71fefde94f4d7205ce360e5568af06b\"><code>fe951e5</code></a>\nAdd support for <code>boolean</code> value for <code>color</code> option\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/ora/issues/244\">#244</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/86aca37a324dcb010da5c04660e5c81a4d8f1f9d\"><code>86aca37</code></a>\n8.1.1</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/818ca34f1fd03d7652965d60cfb3205c29241757\"><code>818ca34</code></a>\nFix frame handling</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/5117dfb69b13d0026a88a8ba5eedc13b4d8df4ad\"><code>5117dfb</code></a>\nFix handling of symbol being empty string in\n<code>stopAndPersist()</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/ora/issues/243\">#243</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/c480a70022c7b892c07c8e45d0a7cc45b9bd93f3\"><code>c480a70</code></a>\nFix CI</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/f8ebaa0cc6c590d03580c8f21912f5d76f544cef\"><code>f8ebaa0</code></a>\n8.1.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/fb0fced9acc24cfe1d41c55c9fb31bce5037b558\"><code>fb0fced</code></a>\nMinor tweaks</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/3c63d5e8569d94564b5280525350724817e9ac26\"><code>3c63d5e</code></a>\n8.0.1</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/commit/89a1f31974c07bf3c75cd823aa611698145d9ca2\"><code>89a1f31</code></a>\nFix the process not exiting</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ora/compare/v5.4.1...v8.2.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=ora&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=5.4.1&new-version=8.2.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot merge` will merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot squash and merge` will squash and merge this PR after\nyour CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot cancel merge` will cancel a previously requested merge\nand block automerging\n- `@dependabot reopen` will reopen this PR if it is closed\n- `@dependabot close` will close this PR and stop Dependabot recreating\nit. You can achieve the same result by closing it manually\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
