          "message": "feat: add `/client` entrypoint in the generated client (#26591)\n\nAllows to do `import { PrismaClient } from './generated/prisma/client'`\nwhen generating in `src/generated/prisma`, and makes it forward\ncompatible with the future ESM client where we won't have `index.js`\nanymore and will have `client.ts` instead of it.\n\nCloses:\nhttps://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-798/add-client-entrypoint-in-the-old-client",
