          "message": "chore(deps-dev): bump log-update from 4.0.0 to 6.1.0 (#26625)\n\nBumps [log-update](https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update) from\n4.0.0 to 6.1.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/releases\">log-update's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v6.1.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Update dependencies  68957e7</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/compare/v6.0.0...v6.1.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/compare/v6.0.0...v6.1.0</a></p>\n<h2>v6.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Breaking</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require Node.js 18  8d6379c</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/compare/v5.0.1...v6.0.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/compare/v5.0.1...v6.0.0</a></p>\n<h2>v5.0.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix height truncation when using styled text (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/issues/57\">#57</a>)\n81b1229</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/compare/v5.0.0...v5.0.1\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/compare/v5.0.0...v5.0.1</a></p>\n<h2>v5.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Breaking</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require Node.js 12.20  d6d51e7</li>\n<li>This package is now pure ESM. Please <a\nhref=\"https://gist.github.com/sindresorhus/a39789f98801d908bbc7ff3ecc99d99c\">read\nthis</a>.</li>\n<li><code>logUpdate.stderr</code> moved into a named export\n<code>logUpdateStderr</code></li>\n<li><code>logUpdate.create</code> moved into a named export\n<code>createLogUpdate</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/compare/v4.0.0...v5.0.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/compare/v4.0.0...v5.0.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/ae78e184f5c5f373bac1b99dc37c5f76abea9060\"><code>ae78e18</code></a>\n6.1.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/68957e7caf68096a7dacbf5e82b211e6bd5bf7d2\"><code>68957e7</code></a>\nUpdate dependencies</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/dc1bb73d250effe2e181c1fb1425a8d866d7609e\"><code>dc1bb73</code></a>\nSimplify</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/3fa6be0cfffafdfb21ec060456c4c7dc07d5039d\"><code>3fa6be0</code></a>\n6.0.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/8d6379c45f16a208c3ba2e199bdc2b574817c45c\"><code>8d6379c</code></a>\nRequire Node.js 18</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/91822b659b249238602e8a69394fdcef63231f5c\"><code>91822b6</code></a>\nFix readme example (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/issues/58\">#58</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/7d74707c93f4da5140dda2b74cb966fd21ff49b5\"><code>7d74707</code></a>\n5.0.1</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/46b382d8868f7e47be2a6d0adea5b66d7e0864b1\"><code>46b382d</code></a>\nMeta tweaks</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/81b1229a83fa12d2d54d933f55a4251492995dd7\"><code>81b1229</code></a>\nFix height truncation when using styled text (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/issues/57\">#57</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/commit/73424532e029c483b0f5f7155204e33989884ec5\"><code>7342453</code></a>\n5.0.0</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/log-update/compare/v4.0.0...v6.1.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=log-update&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=4.0.0&new-version=6.1.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot merge` will merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot squash and merge` will squash and merge this PR after\nyour CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot cancel merge` will cancel a previously requested merge\nand block automerging\n- `@dependabot reopen` will reopen this PR if it is closed\n- `@dependabot close` will close this PR and stop Dependabot recreating\nit. You can achieve the same result by closing it manually\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
