          "message": "refactor: drop legacy seed migration script warnings (#26624)\n\nThis PR drops a warning / helper message that we output to help users\nmigrate from an old seed script setup to a new one. This was added over\n3 years ago => I think by now all users who care about this have\nmigrated and we can drop this logic.\n\nDone in scope of the `schemaPath` refactoring to get rid of the various\nschemaPath usages in this code. ;)",
