          "id": "61c35242a6f5425716b822d1800bbb00166c0296",
          "message": "refactor(schema loading): ORM-667 refactor schema loading (#26588)\n\nThis is a first PR in a series of refactorings for the `schemaPath`\nhandling.\n\nIn this PR I mainly address the logic in the `ensureDatabaseExists` file\nso it does not perform redundant schema file loading and parsing. For\nthis I introduce a new `SchemaContext` object which holds the bundled\nand most relevant information about the schema:\n\n- Its file contents\n- The schema root path\n- Parsed datasource and generator information\n\nNext steps (outside this PR):\n- Refactor the `Migrate` class\n- Refactor the `SchemaEngine` class\n=> See https://github.com/prisma/prisma/pull/26596\n\nref [ORM-667: Untangle uses of schema-path in the\ncodebase](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-667/untangle-uses-of-schema-path-in-the-codebase)",
