          "message": "chore(deps): update engines to 6.6.0-21.d1dbe8880430b6f753dffc4264de1a7f39e4a15a (#26652)\n\nThe base branch for this PR is: main\nThis automatic PR updates the engines to version\n`6.6.0-21.d1dbe8880430b6f753dffc4264de1a7f39e4a15a`.\nThis will get automatically merged if all the tests pass.\n:warning: If this PR needs to be updated, first remove the `automerge`\nlabel before pushing to avoid automerge to merge without waiting for\ntests.\n## Packages\n| Package | NPM URL |\n|---------|---------|\n|`@prisma/engines-version`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/engines-version/v/6.6.0-21.d1dbe8880430b6f753dffc4264de1a7f39e4a15a|\n|`@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm/v/6.6.0-21.d1dbe8880430b6f753dffc4264de1a7f39e4a15a|\n|`@prisma/query-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-engine-wasm/v/6.6.0-21.d1dbe8880430b6f753dffc4264de1a7f39e4a15a|\n|`@prisma/query-compiler-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-compiler-wasm/v/6.6.0-21.d1dbe8880430b6f753dffc4264de1a7f39e4a15a|\n## Engines commit\n\n[`prisma/prisma-engines@d1dbe8880430b6f753dffc4264de1a7f39e4a15a`](https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/commit/d1dbe8880430b6f753dffc4264de1a7f39e4a15a)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
