          "id": "f58fd03a81e42b2641054220203410e026533343",
          "message": "chore(deps-dev): bump globals from 15.13.0 to 16.0.0 (#26666)\n\nBumps [globals](https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals) from 15.13.0 to\n16.0.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/releases\">globals's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v16.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Breaking</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>The <code>serviceworker</code> globals are now generated from\nbrowsers (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/globals/issues/281\">#281</a>)\n039ed51\n<ul>\n<li>It's a breaking change as a few globals have been removed.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/compare/v15.15.0...v16.0.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/compare/v15.15.0...v16.0.0</a></p>\n<h2>v15.15.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Regenerate vitest globals (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/globals/issues/279\">#279</a>)\n445df81</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/compare/v15.14.0...v15.15.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/compare/v15.14.0...v15.15.0</a></p>\n<h2>v15.14.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>vitest</code> globals (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/globals/issues/274\">#274</a>)\n06a5723</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/compare/v15.13.0...v15.14.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/compare/v15.13.0...v15.14.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/efb324782720e6f97d13651fa73ae32ef4ca01b4\"><code>efb3247</code></a>\n16.0.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/75cb90a671f899c2a1e578888a9cc14a3f4e3d83\"><code>75cb90a</code></a>\nUpdate globals (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/globals/issues/285\">#285</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/d018eeb8eb441db9530b40865dd7fd0cf4dfc818\"><code>d018eeb</code></a>\nFix <code>serviceworker</code> environment name (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/globals/issues/284\">#284</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/f9dd68399d2197953612ced8c35f8f78132b45e0\"><code>f9dd683</code></a>\nFix filename case</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/039ed515af5ae6c387f1fbc66baef72d8636bfe1\"><code>039ed51</code></a>\nAdd script to get service worker globals (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/globals/issues/281\">#281</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/8a43ab65056483c0248c7be3a69fdb2866d859a2\"><code>8a43ab6</code></a>\n15.15.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/445df813ad61b475be210fe12be155b144310462\"><code>445df81</code></a>\nRegenerate vitest globals (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/globals/issues/279\">#279</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/504276b5f1f6475720a3b9b7f6158d72f2bd6ad8\"><code>504276b</code></a>\nFix &quot;Update&quot; job (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/globals/issues/277\">#277</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/48c7b51a8fb284142f88fe34ada7558c0531c44f\"><code>48c7b51</code></a>\n15.14.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/commit/06a572349b08709b49d8999038961558da4da4e7\"><code>06a5723</code></a>\nAdd <code>vitest</code> globals (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/globals/issues/274\">#274</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/globals/compare/v15.13.0...v16.0.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=globals&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=15.13.0&new-version=16.0.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot merge` will merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot squash and merge` will squash and merge this PR after\nyour CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot cancel merge` will cancel a previously requested merge\nand block automerging\n- `@dependabot reopen` will reopen this PR if it is closed\n- `@dependabot close` will close this PR and stop Dependabot recreating\nit. You can achieve the same result by closing it manually\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
