          "id": "8405dd85d1a5cc2cfc296a1a94b0eaf482f843bd",
          "message": "feat(config): add \"migrate\" property to configure Schema Engine (#26655)\n\nThis PR:\n- closes\n[ORM-698](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-698/prisma-config-configure-driver-adapter-for-migrations)\n- adds support for the new `migrate` property in `prisma.config.ts`,\nwhich configures the Driver Adapter to use for `prisma migrate` +\n`prisma db` commands\n\n  ```typescript\n  import { defineConfig } from 'prisma/config'\n  \n  type Env = {\n    LIBSQL_DATABASE_URL: string,\n    LIBSQL_AUTH_TOKEN: string,\n  }\n\n  export default defineConfig<Env>({\n    earlyAccess: true,\n    migrate: {\n      adapter: async (env) => {\n        const { PrismaLibSQL } = await import('@prisma/adapter-libsql')\n        return new PrismaLibSQL(...)\n      }\n    }\n  })\n\n  ```\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
