          "message": "refactor: extract `@prisma/dmmf` and `@prisma/generator` packages (#26660)\n\nExtract new `@prisma/dmmf` and `@prisma/generator` packages that provide\ncommon types and utilities for all kinds of generators.\n\n`@prisma/generator-helper` remains in this major version for backward\ncompatibility with third-party generators that will still be using the\nold JSON-RPC interface, and builds upon `@prisma/generator` and\n`@prisma/dmmf`.\n\nRefs: ORM-811",
