          "id": "172e8a18dee3d74681bb756947b399dfdf6b857a",
          "message": "chore(deps-dev): bump @slack/webhook from 7.0.4 to 7.0.5 (#26690)\n\nBumps [@slack/webhook](https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk) from\n7.0.4 to 7.0.5.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/releases\"><code>@​slack/webhook</code>'s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><code>@​slack/webhook</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.0.5</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<p>This patch release updates the <code>axios</code> dependency used to\nsend webhooks with internal bug fixes.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>fix(webhook): bump axios to 1.8.3 to address CVE-2025-27152 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/zimeg\"><code>@​zimeg</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/pull/2173\">slackapi/node-slack-sdk#2173</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/compare/@slack/webhook@7.0.4..@slack/webhook@7.0.5\">https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/compare/<code>@​slack/webhook</code><code>@​7.0.4..</code><code>@​slack/webhook</code><code>@​7.0.5</code></a>\n<strong>Milestone</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/milestone/130\">https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/milestone/130</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/6618482ad5ac9e100c5ecf47fd5169e97d11ef67\"><code>6618482</code></a>\nchore(webhook): release <code>@​slack/webhook</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.0.5 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/issues/2174\">#2174</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/a0e79f98c58f82ce0991349682a1ce4903b54183\"><code>a0e79f9</code></a>\nfix(webhook): bump axios to 1.8.3 to address CVE-2025-27152 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/issues/2173\">#2173</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/6012cf3b25f7dbd205891f454401b39b08f6d9fa\"><code>6012cf3</code></a>\nchore(deps): bump prismjs from 1.29.0 to 1.30.0 in /docs (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/issues/2171\">#2171</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/039bd050cd736d666d063397067cb014adf23711\"><code>039bd05</code></a>\nDocs - matches site css to slack.dev and docs.slack.dev (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/issues/2155\">#2155</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/833636e505e1702f161862bf4f1207f42a7001d8\"><code>833636e</code></a>\nchore(deps): bump the react group across 1 directory with 2 updates (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/issues/2165\">#2165</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/111cd5166066ed5b7df487e8f8a220e8079c6a9c\"><code>111cd51</code></a>\nfix: configure dependabot to group react deps (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/issues/2164\">#2164</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/c699a4690923b42a2521469329490faa52c6bac5\"><code>c699a46</code></a>\nchore(deps-dev): bump the docusaurus group across 1 directory with 3\nupdates ...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/ffd5f15d5f464907cd5ccee7b7a9f2911def3784\"><code>ffd5f15</code></a>\nchore(cli-hooks): release <code>@​slack/cli-hooks</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/1\"><code>@​1</code></a>.2.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/issues/2154\">#2154</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/e56f0edd3af34d0536bae9793bd55d3e5119691b\"><code>e56f0ed</code></a>\nfeat(cli-hooks): exit the start process with the subprocess exit code\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/issues/2153\">#2153</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/commit/9048fd9a9db902f808fc31da53ac4bc7b2c9e042\"><code>9048fd9</code></a>\nfeat(cli-hooks): output node warnings to stderr for debugging outputs\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/issues/2152\">#2152</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/slackapi/node-slack-sdk/compare/@slack/webhook@7.0.4...@slack/webhook@7.0.5\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=@slack/webhook&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=7.0.4&new-version=7.0.5)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot merge` will merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot squash and merge` will squash and merge this PR after\nyour CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot cancel merge` will cancel a previously requested merge\nand block automerging\n- `@dependabot reopen` will reopen this PR if it is closed\n- `@dependabot close` will close this PR and stop Dependabot recreating\nit. You can achieve the same result by closing it manually\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
