          "id": "87d1af13b2d15f4141f9efdc0ad5ed3421b5b0ec",
          "message": "ci: fix mysql setup on macos (#26699)\n\nhttps://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-services tap was deprecated\nyesterday after the functionality was merged into Homebrew itself, and\nall of its code was removed. This broke the `brew services` command in\nall Homebrew installations that are older than 4.4.25 (released\nyesterday) and didn't have `homebrew-services` tapped locally (i.e.\nnever ran `brew services` before) which is exactly the case in the macOS\nimage on GitHub Actions.\n\nThe fix is to update Homebrew to the latest version.",
