          "message": "feat(adapter-d1): add HTTP version of D1 adapter (#26692)\n\nThis PR:\n- closes\n[ORM-693](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-693/d1-driver-create-migration-adapter-using-new-http-binding)\n- exposes a new HTTP-based adapter for D1, `PrismaD1HTTP`, mostly useful\nfor running migrations against remote instances of Cloudflare D1\n\nI've tested this adapter locally, and I delegate writing a proper test\nsuite to a PR in `prisma/ecosystem-tests` run against an integration\nversion of this PR.\n\n/integration\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
