          "message": "feat: add prisma-client-ts generator (#26707)\n\nAdd the `prisma-client-ts` generator as a fork of `prisma-client-js`.\n\nIt is a full copy, there aren't any real changes to review, they are\ngoing to be in subsequent pull requests.\n\nWe will extract more code to be shared between the two generators later,\nonce the new one is finalized and the file splitting changes are ported.\n\nCloses:\nhttps://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-829/add-prisma-client-ts-generator",
