          "id": "0d21e956c60f1a9e46efff4a8224312fdf867d77",
          "message": "chore(deps): update terminal-link to v4 (#26762)\n\nUpdate `terminal-link` to v4.\n\nIt was an attempt to get rid of a transitive CommonJS dependency\n`supports-color@7.2.0` that was causing issues in the ESM runtime bundle\nin the client and which has a newer ESM-compatible version, however even\nthe latest `terminal-link` still depends on the old `supports-color`.\n\nThat said, it doesn't hurt updating it to the latest version anyway, and\nthis still reduces the amount of CommonJS dependencies in the project.",
