          "id": "9764ec788b25565f78cb89a75a5f4f672987974d",
          "message": "feat(config): map migrate.adapter and studio.adapter types (#26781)\n\nThis PR:\n- maps `configInput: PrismaConfig` -> `config: PrismaConfigInternal`\ntypes, specifically:\n- ~~`configInput.studio` now receives a\n`SqlMigrationAwareDriverAdapterFactory`, while `config.studio` returns a\n`SqlDriverAdapter`~~ doing so broke tests, reverted in\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma/pull/26781/commits/65f5c825576144bd380527d3e05b29f05f75bd70\n- `configInput.migrate` now receives a\n`SqlMigrationAwareDriverAdapterFactory`, while `config.migrate` returns\na `ErrorCapturingSqlMigrationAwareDriverAdapterFactory`\n- adjusts `@prisma/config` tests\n- exposes new utilities in `@prisma/driver-adapter-utils`\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
