          "message": "feat(migrate): conditionally drop support for CLI flags when using `@prisma/schema-engine-wasm` (#26799)\n\nThis PR:\n- closes\n[ORM-701](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-701/prisma-config-conditionally-drop-support-for-flags-when-using-a)\n\nWhen a Schema Engine Driver Adapter is given in prisma.config.ts, we\nshould drop support for the following subsets of Prisma commands:'\n\n- [x] prisma migrate diff: --from-url, --to-url,\n--from-schema-datasource, --to-schema-datasource, --shadow-database-url,\n--to-local-d1, --from-local-d1\n- [x] prisma db execute: --url\n- [x] prisma db pull: --url, --local-d1\n\nThis is needed to make the Wasm-ification feasible for schema-core, and\nto conform to the new D1 migration strategy.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
          "timestamp": "2025-04-02T15:43:54+02:00",
