          "id": "280c5fbbc9e8c1e02bc4a749324107398036c10a",
          "message": "feat(generator-registry): add `prisma-client` alias (#26819)\n\nAs agreed with Dev Connections, we want the new generator to be called\njust `prisma-client`, as it will become the only generator in the\nfuture.\n\nThis commit adds the new name as an alias for `prisma-client-ts` so we\ndon't need to change anything internally for now, and can refer to it as\n`prisma-client-ts` even if we already communicate the new name to the\nusers. The next step will be to migrate to the new name internally.",
