          "id": "563ab02a4a4eb67483820cce1ba79f55019fb570",
          "message": "chore(deps): update engines to 6.7.0-9.862884157a1bc992edb7daedf32519157cbad9a1 (#26875)\n\nThe base branch for this PR is: main\nThis automatic PR updates the engines to version\n`6.7.0-9.862884157a1bc992edb7daedf32519157cbad9a1`.\nThis will get automatically merged if all the tests pass.\n:warning: If this PR needs to be updated, first remove the `automerge`\nlabel before pushing to avoid automerge to merge without waiting for\ntests.\n## Packages\n| Package | NPM URL |\n|---------|---------|\n|`@prisma/engines-version`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/engines-version/v/6.7.0-9.862884157a1bc992edb7daedf32519157cbad9a1|\n|`@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm/v/6.7.0-9.862884157a1bc992edb7daedf32519157cbad9a1|\n|`@prisma/query-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-engine-wasm/v/6.7.0-9.862884157a1bc992edb7daedf32519157cbad9a1|\n|`@prisma/query-compiler-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-compiler-wasm/v/6.7.0-9.862884157a1bc992edb7daedf32519157cbad9a1|\n|`@prisma/schema-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/schema-engine-wasm/v/6.7.0-9.862884157a1bc992edb7daedf32519157cbad9a1|\n## Engines commit\n\n[`prisma/prisma-engines@862884157a1bc992edb7daedf32519157cbad9a1`](https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/commit/862884157a1bc992edb7daedf32519157cbad9a1)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jacek Malec <malec@prisma.io>",
