          "distinct": true,
          "id": "1342d6b75d2d908e7587049eebf503e0a1ef35b0",
          "message": "fix(client): propagate `dirname` from `client.ts` to `class.ts` (#26905)\n\n<https://github.com/prisma/prisma/pull/26892> added the missing\n`__dirname` ESM shim to `class.ts` but one more issue remained: moving\nthe client configuration to `internals/class.ts` changed the value of\n`__dirname` to point at the `internals` directory and not at the client\ndirectory itself, causing issues like SQLite databases not being found\nin new e2e tests. At the same time, we cannot use\n`path.dirname(__dirname)` because it will only work as long as the\nclient is not bundled, and will lead to incorrect results if the client\nis bundled. Therefore it's actually not correct to use `__dirname` in\n`internals/*` at all, and we must propagate it from the `client.ts` file\ndownstream to whatever other files need it.\n\nThis commit replaces the `PrismaClient` export of `internals/class.ts`\nwith a function that takes `dirname` as an argument and returns the\n`PrismaClient` class. Calling this function is deferred to the\n`client.ts` file.",
          "timestamp": "2025-04-15T18:07:40+02:00",
          "tree_id": "8093c5fa8a4791820a42cba03e41be4376682dee",
          "url": "https://github.com/prisma/prisma/commit/1342d6b75d2d908e7587049eebf503e0a1ef35b0"
