          "id": "16bb35baac1d1e9bd2dd1e31424a4ce8f7be29be",
          "message": "feat(qc): Data mapper (#26929)\n\nA tree structure of `ResultNode` instances represent the expected shape\nof the result data. It includes the output field names, database field\nname and the data types to cast to.\n\nThe root `ResultNode` is stored in a `DataMap` expression node, which\nwraps the entire query. This node drives the transformation of the query\nresult to the expected shape and coercing to the expected data types as\nneeded inside the Query Interpreter on the client side.\n\nImplements\n[ORM-734](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-734/design-and-implement-data-mapper-nodes)\n\nDepends on https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/pull/5343",
