          "id": "da47226d97285f314cfe15fe5d2893063497be96",
          "message": "fix(d1): ORM-885 remove miniflare from D1 adapter (#26950)\n\nThis PR addresses an issue with the D1 driver adapter in edge runtimes\nlike Cloudflare Workers and Vercel.\n\nWith the recent addition of SQLMigrationAwareDriverAdapters the D1\nadapter got a dependency upon miniflare. This however is not compatible\nwith Cloudflare Workers and other browser or edge runtimes.\n\nThe solution is to drop the miniflare parts fully. For migrations one\nwill need the D1HTTP adapter variant anyways. (see @jacek-prisma\ncomments below)\n\nFixes ORM-885\nFixes #26881 \nFixes #26878",
          "timestamp": "2025-04-24T12:49:19+02:00",
          "tree_id": "6d61d63a5cab03203f4d59fbd9b40aa58a56f3b6",
