          "message": "chore(deps): update engines to 6.7.0-28.2a4af470dcf83a3f6d9d5e739e23380449936435 (#26967)\n\nThe base branch for this PR is: main\nThis automatic PR updates the engines to version\n`6.7.0-28.2a4af470dcf83a3f6d9d5e739e23380449936435`.\nThis will get automatically merged if all the tests pass.\n:warning: If this PR needs to be updated, first remove the `automerge`\nlabel before pushing to avoid automerge to merge without waiting for\ntests.\n## Packages\n| Package | NPM URL |\n|---------|---------|\n|`@prisma/engines-version`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/engines-version/v/6.7.0-28.2a4af470dcf83a3f6d9d5e739e23380449936435|\n|`@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm/v/6.7.0-28.2a4af470dcf83a3f6d9d5e739e23380449936435|\n|`@prisma/query-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-engine-wasm/v/6.7.0-28.2a4af470dcf83a3f6d9d5e739e23380449936435|\n|`@prisma/query-compiler-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-compiler-wasm/v/6.7.0-28.2a4af470dcf83a3f6d9d5e739e23380449936435|\n|`@prisma/schema-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/schema-engine-wasm/v/6.7.0-28.2a4af470dcf83a3f6d9d5e739e23380449936435|\n## Engines commit\n\n[`prisma/prisma-engines@2a4af470dcf83a3f6d9d5e739e23380449936435`](https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/commit/2a4af470dcf83a3f6d9d5e739e23380449936435)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jacek Malec <malec@prisma.io>",
