          "id": "867c43a9fbd9a9fa95b057550223f852e06fd721",
          "message": "fix(cli): use native fetch in PDP CLI  (#27131)\n\nThis fixes the \"Premature close\" error when creating a Prisma Postgres\ndatabase via `prisma init --db`, caused by incorrect chunked response\nhandling by `node-fetch` that happens under specific circumstances.\n\nSince we only support Node.js 18+ and other modern runtimes, we can use\nstandard `fetch`.\n\n`node-fetch` is still used in a few places where removing it there is a\nlittle more involved than just removing the dependency.",
