          "id": "338cb01833a6d8f890cc538875726ffcee7d45aa",
          "message": "fix: various batching fixes (#27229)\n\n[ORM-918](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-918/transactional-batching)\n\nFixes all important batching tests.\nSome notes:\n- `batching raw rollback` works, but it's ignored because we generate a\ndifferent (better) error message than the driver adapter and it uses a\nshared snapshot\n- `invalid level generates run- and compile- time error` fails because\nof a problem related to isolation levels, not batching\n- other batching tests that are failing are failing because they use raw\nqueries",
          "timestamp": "2025-05-21T19:07:12+01:00",
          "tree_id": "e63998ed867c6d9eb22f8b485e8d398d00e3fac6",
