          "message": "fix: make data mapper return tagged values in JSON protocol format (#27239)\n\nPort much of the [prisma-engines driver adapters data mapping\nlogic](https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/blob/e17d3735a57aa4748b05b824e366c69cf2cc774f/libs/driver-adapters/src/conversion/js_to_quaint.rs#L68-L297)\nto `DataMapper` and return non-primitive values in the JSON protocol\nformat, to be decoded later in `deserializeJsonResponse`.\n\nCloses:\nhttps://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1002/fix-serializationdeserialization-for-regular-queries-in-prismaprisma\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jacek-prisma <malec@prisma.io>",
