          "message": "chore: revert \"don't generate index file in ESM without bundlers\" (#27314)\n\nReverts prisma/prisma#27277\n\nThis was not communicated to DA timely but it will require docs changes\nand release notes.\n\nThe details of implementation also warrant further discussion and\nrefinement. The idea behind the PR was to play it safe and only remove\nthe index file in the cases where it was not useful anyway, but our\nCommonJS detection is not complete enough for that and misses some cases\n(e.g. `\"moduleResolution\": \"node16\"` and no `\"type\": \"module\"` in\n`package.json`.",
