          "id": "42166a0d39d035f80b8d84ee937fedc85980b9f6",
          "message": "feat: add RunnableContext object as additional arg passed to dynamic subcommands (#27425)\n\nAdding an additional `RunnableContext` argument to the invocation of\ndynamic subcommands. For now only the cli version is passed through. But\nin the future we can add additional data or even shared utility\nfunctions here (e.g. for tracking, logging, ...).\n\nNote: For now we do not export the type of this `RunnableContext`. So\nSubcommands have to \"know\" by themself. Not ideal but something we\nexpand once we get more complex things here.\n\nAs requested by @igalklebanov to workaround some issues with pre 6.10.0\nprisma versions and `prisma dev`.",
