          "id": "76fe0664e19ae70221c6cf0494c29a9ad6f4e35e",
          "message": "fix(qc): fix Bytes ID issue (#27460)\n\nThe problem in this case is that the standard format for byte arrays in\nthe driver adapters is `number[]`, so when we read an array of bytes out\nof one query and then forward it to another it gets passed as `number[]`\narg, but that causes comparisons to fail, since the drivers do not map\nthe arg into a byte array. This does not involve the DataMapper because\nthis happens before the query plan completes.\n\nThe change modifies `serializeSql` to convert byte array columns into\n`Uint8Array`.\n\n\n[ORM-1123](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1123/fix-nested-select-returns-null)\n\nFixes https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/27455",
          "timestamp": "2025-06-20T11:37:24+01:00",
          "tree_id": "d60582cced4926360e72d9d8787d9213a89bf992",
