          "id": "0eab16051a3dbd205c5d76f8ca7540531053c819",
          "message": "feat(config): lift \"config.migrate.adapter\" into \"config.adapter\" (#27618)\n\nThis PR:\n- Closes\n[ORM-1194](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1194/prismaconfigts-refactor-migrateadapter-adapter)\n- Refactors how the Prisma CLI Driver Adapter is declared in\n`prisma.config.ts`\n- Lifts`config.migrate.adapter` into `config.adapter`, effectively\neliminating the `config.migrate` key in `prisma.config.ts`\n- Removes the `env: Env` argument from the `adapter` async factory\nfunction\n- Removes the `Env` type-level argument from `defineConfig` and the\n`adapter` async factory function\n\n---\n\nThis is breaking, but it's fine, as prisma.config.ts is still in early\naccess.\n\nUsers can migrate to the new config (pun intended) via:\n\n```diff\ntype Env = {\n  connectionString: string\n}\n\n+ export default defineConfig({\n- export default defineConfig<Env>({\n+   adapter: async () => { /* ... */ },\n-   migrate: {\n-     adapter: async (env /* : Env */) => { /* ... */ },\n-   }\n})\n```\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Florian Gößler <florian.goessler@hey.com>",
