          "id": "4b4215f01b432b812438e9fd7988f7c1658e0718",
          "message": "feat(config): add support for custom `path` for `migrations`, `views`, `typedSql` (#27620)\n\nTo merge into https://github.com/prisma/prisma/pull/27618.\n\nThis PR:\n- Closes\n[ORM-1202](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1202/prismaconfigts-support-custom-path-in-migrations-views-typedsql)\n- Adds the following to `prisma.config.ts`:\n- `migrations.path` (fixes\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/26027, provides an alternative\nto https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/4720)\n  - `views.path`\n  - `typedSql.path`\n- Fixes the output of `prisma migrate dev` so that it actually prints\nthe correct relative migrations path\n---\n\n```typescript\n// ./prisma.config.ts\n\nimport { defineConfig } from 'prisma/config'\nimport 'dotenv/config'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  earlyAccess: true,\n  schema: './prisma/schema.prisma',\n  /**\n   * Configuration for Prisma migrations.\n   */\n  migrations: {\n    /**\n     * The path to the directory where Prisma should store migration files, and look for them.\n     */\n    path: './prisma/custom/migrations',\n  },\n  /**\n   * Configuration for the `typedSql` preview feature.\n   */\n  typedSql: {\n    /**\n     * The path to the directory where Prisma should look for the `typedSql` queries, where *.sql files will be loaded.\n     */\n    path: './prisma/custom/typedSql',\n  },\n  /**\n   * Configuration for the `views` preview feature.\n   */\n  views: {\n    /**\n     * The path to the directory where Prisma should look for the `views` queries, where *.sql files will be loaded.\n     */\n    path: './prisma/custom/views',\n  },\n})\n```\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
          "timestamp": "2025-07-10T16:28:40+04:00",
