          "id": "0345aa95702f223c19f7b29852ba5c0b43e4890e",
          "message": "fix: copy wasm files to output path in prisma-client generator (#27623)\n\nWhen generating the client for bundlers or for runtimes in which we use\n`import` rather than `readFile` to load the WebAssembly module, copy the\nWebAssembly binary and the JavaScript bindings to it into the generated\nclient directory to avoid issues with bundlers.\n\nCloses:\nhttps://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1187/refactor-prisma-client-copy-wasm-mjs-js-assets-to-internal-generated",
