          "id": "4ba02d29d8256d643f9dfcc1a785c5321a0412d8",
          "message": "feat(config): display warning when `package.json#prisma` is detected when loading Prisma config; move Prisma config diagnostics to stderr (#27711)\n\nThis PR:\n- closes\n[ORM-1221](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1221/prismaconfigts-fix-27609-breaking-prisma-migrate-diff)\n- closes\n[ORM-1217](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1217/prismaconfigts-warn-when-prisma-key-is-found-in-packagejson)\n- fixes https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/27609\n- adds warnings to `@prisma/config`\n- shows a deprecation warning whenever `package.json#prisma` is detected\n- shows a warning informing that Prisma config files take precedence\nover `package.json#prisma`\n- these diagnostics are accumulated: it's the responsibility of the\ncaller to emit them. This is to work around some problems that are\ncommented in the code in `packages/cli/src/bin.ts`.\n- ensures that diagnostic messages emitted when loading the Prisma\nconfig file (e.g., `prisma.config.ts`) are displayed in stderr, so that\nthey don't get in the way of the structured output expected by commands\nsuch as `prisma migrate diff --script` and `prisma version --json`\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
