          "distinct": true,
          "id": "2dcebb3d2849e8661002f4c307e02937a70481c3",
          "message": "feat(config): add migrations.seed support (#27724)\n\nThis PR:\n- closes\n[ORM-1214](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1214/prismaconfigts-implement-replacement-for-prismaseed-in-packagejson)\n- Add `migrations.seed` optional string attribute in Prisma Config file\n(e.g., `prisma.config.ts`)\n- Stop reading `package.json#prisma` config when a Prisma Config file is\ndetected and loaded\n\nExample:\n- From `package.json` (old way)\n  ```diff\n    // package.json\n    {\n      \"type\": \"module\",\n      \"devDependencies\": {\n        \"tsx\": \"latest\"\n      },\n  -   \"prisma\": {\n  -     \"seed\": \"tsx ./prisma/seed.ts\"\n  -   }\n    }\n  ```\n- To `prisma.config.ts` (new way)\n  ```diff\n    // prisma.config.ts\n    import { defineConfig } from 'prisma/config'\n  \n    export default defineConfig({\n      earlyAccess: true,\n  +   migrations: {\n  +     seed: 'tsx ./prisma/seed.ts'\n  +   }\n    })\n  ```\n\n---\n\nNote: you may want to review\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma/pull/27724/commits/c33aee9e847b82b0d635a78f6874ebdbdcfc5640\nseparately.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
