          "id": "1116170f69d90690e1b6e9396a72c670d99cf5c7",
          "message": "fix(qc): fix various data/format issues (#27830)\n\n[ORM-1233](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1233/fix-failing-postgres-data-type-tests)\nand\n[ORM-1169](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1169/align-query-error-messages)\n\nFixes all the tests listed in the tickets.\n\nChanges include:\n- addition of `originalCode` and `originalMessage` to errors raised from\ndriver adapters\n- explicit handling for raw query errors that surface the original code\nand emssage\n- normalizing the output of raw queries to avoid differences in\nsnapshots due to formatting\n- differentation between `Json` and `Object` types, where `Object`\nrepresents deserialized JSON and `Json` means serialized JSON, I've had\nto add handling for an edge case with relation joins where values come\nback deserialized\n- addition of missing type parsers for JSON arrays for pg and neon\n(they'd fall back to the default parsers which would deserialize the\nJSON, which is not what we want)\n- handling for arrays in `serializeRawSql`\n\nEngine part: https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/pull/5575\n\n/engine-branch fix/fix-data-and-format-errors",
