          "id": "9b0899d65b457e0323a00aa61938596afc1492da",
          "message": "chore: don't build wasm-base64 cjs bundles (#27887)\n\nWe always load them using `await import()` which *expects* an ES module,\nregardless of whether it's used from an ES module or a CommonJS module.\nThe CommonJS variants of these bundles bring no value. Removing them\nreduces the size of the client package by about 12.5 MB before\ncompression.",
