          "id": "f88447a49239adabe5b5f5cfff0b1bbf6d624b87",
          "message": "fix(client-generator-ts): build Node.js wasm loader on Bun and Deno (#27886)\n\n1. Replace the check for `target: 'nodejs'` in `utils/wasm.ts` to a call\nto the newly introduced `isNodeJsLike` function, which checks that the\ntarget runtime is Node.js, Bun, or Deno.\n\n2. Unify Deno targets and remove the separate `deno-deploy` target (but\nkeep it as an alias that normalizes to `deno`).\n\nCloses:\nhttps://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1346/ensure-runtime-=-bun-behaves-identically-to-runtime-=-nodejs",
