          "id": "b4346333a346ce91d2251a38b9c882fa84567f42",
          "message": "fix(client-generator-ts): fix \"prisma generate\" when no model is defined (#27944)\n\nThis PR:\n- closes\n[ORM-1175](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1175/prisma-client-support-prisma-generate-with-no-models)\n- fixes https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/27926\n\nIt allows `prisma generate` to work with a `schema.prisma` file with the\n`prisma-client` generator and no model:\n\n```prisma\ngenerator client {\n  provider = \"prisma-client\"\n  output   = \"../generated/client\"\n}\n\ndatasource db {\n  provider = \"postgresql\"\n  url      = env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n}\n```\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
