          "message": "test(client): cover typedSql + queryCompiler + @prisma/adapter-libsql (#27801)\n\nThis PR:\n- contributes to\n[ORM-1073](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1073/verify-or-fix-esm-support-for-typedsql)\n- showcases an e2e test where `typedSql` fails when paired with\n`queryCompiler` and `@prisma/adapter-better-sqlite3`\n- the test is mostly copied from\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma-examples/pull/8258\n\nThe error log is:\n\n```\nprisma:driver-adapter:better-sqlite3 [js::queryRaw] '{\\n' +\n  '  \"sql\": \"SELECT te.\\\\\"id\\\\\", te.\\\\\"type\\\\\", te.\\\\\"variant\\\\\"\\\\nFROM \\\\\"TrackingEvent\\\\\" te\\\\nWHERE\\\\n($1 IS NULL OR te.\\\\\"type\\\\\" IN (SELECT value FROM json_each($1)))\\\\nAND ($2 IS NULL OR te.\\\\\"variant\\\\\" IN (SELECT value FROM json_each($2)))\",\\n' +\n  '  \"args\": [\\n' +\n  '    \"[\\\\\"PageOpened\\\\\",\\\\\"ButtonClicked\\\\\"]\",\\n' +\n  '    \"[\\\\\"BlueBuyButton\\\\\",\\\\\"RedBuyButton\\\\\"]\"\\n' +\n  '  ],\\n' +\n  '  \"argTypes\": [\\n' +\n  '    \"Text\",\\n' +\n  '    \"Text\"\\n' +\n  '  ]\\n' +\n  '}' +7ms\nprisma:driver-adapter:better-sqlite3 Error in performIO: '{}' +0ms\n<path>/generator-prisma-client/basic-typedsql-query-compiler/node_modules/.pnpm/@prisma+adapter-better-sqlite3@6.13.0/node_modules/@prisma/adapter-better-sqlite3/dist/index.js:519\n      const stmt = this.client.prepare(query.sql).bind(mapQueryArgs(query.args, query.argTypes));\n                                                  ^\n\nRangeError: Too many parameter values were provided\n```\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jacek Malec <malec@prisma.io>",
