          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6f76497d6cf7c2d78a72b6a12d2eb887fc3f4648",
          "message": "chore: use turborepo for parallel builds (#28024)\n\nI propose to use `turborepo` for the monorepo setup and depend on its\ndependency resolution algorithm instead of custom `esbuild` plugin.\nHence we could save around 3 minutes on clean builds. And below are some\nnumbers for comparison and output if nothing is changed.\n\n```sh\n Tasks:    33 successful, 33 total\nCached:    33 cached, 33 total\n  Time:    346ms >>> FULL TURBO\n```\n\n### On M1 Pro\n\nBefore \n\n```sh\n  Tasks:    33 successful, 33 total\n Cached:    0 cached, 33 total\n   Time:    4m53.178s \n```\n\nAfter\n\n```sh\n Tasks:    33 successful, 33 total\nCached:    0 cached, 33 total\n  Time:    2m5.925s \n```\n\n### On GitHub Actions\n\nBefore\n\n```sh\n Tasks:    33 successful, 33 total\nCached:    0 cached, 33 total\n  Time:    8m43.245s \n```\n\nAfter\n\n```sh\n Tasks:    33 successful, 33 total\nCached:    0 cached, 33 total\n  Time:    5m37.205s \n```",
          "timestamp": "2025-09-04T12:58:32+02:00",
          "tree_id": "ebcf043b5eaf4a6ffda7d507fb4bbec4e8dab910",
