          "id": "d368e9fadff80681a9e87a6d1e4ae920c071753d",
          "message": "fix(adapter-pg): error event listener leak (#28057)\n\nFixes an issue where when executing enough transactions in quick\nsuccession and pg-pool starts to reuse clients, error handlers are\nre-attached to them but old ones aren't removed, causing the\n`MaxListenersExceededWarning` and supposedly a memory leak.\n\nCloses #28037",
