          "id": "493cf1c618697f2f704d652df62a5c36cd1680e6",
          "message": "test(client): run qc tests with remote executor (#27971)\n\nMove the QPE source code into this repo (extracted into a [base\nPR](https://github.com/prisma/prisma/pull/28031) to make reviewing this\nPR easier, everything in the diff of this PR is what was actually\nchanged), port it from a Deno+Oak application to a\nmulti-platform/multi-runtime library using Hono as the web framework and\nNode.js+Vitest as the development stack, use it as a library in the\nfunctional tests to test the `RemoteExecutor` in `ClientEngine`. The QPE\nbinary is still a Deno app, but it's just a tiny wrapper around this\nlibrary (https://github.com/prisma/query-plan-executor/pull/42).\n\nThis PR also fixes a bunch of bugs uncovered by the tests (both in QPE\nand in `RemoteExecutor`) and skips some other failing tests that would\ntake more effort to fix (they are now tracked in separate Linear\ntickets).\n\nCloses:\nhttps://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/ORM-1350/run-tests-with-qcaccelerateqpe",
          "timestamp": "2025-09-09T11:19:02+02:00",
          "tree_id": "fde11375b886f6f0888d131c9269fa4fc6374488",
