          "id": "1c4452d55fce1d591eafb27081606736959bfc1d",
          "message": "fix(query-plan-executor): don't override ssl config object (#28224)\n\nI misread the documentation, the parsed connection string overrides the\n`ssl` configuration object and not the other way around.\n\nThis commit fixes the above issue and simplifies the code by updating\nthe URL object to treat `require` as `no-verify` instead of\nre-implementing the ssl params parsing logic.\n\nThis is not a complete fix for TML-1482 because `rejectUnauthorized:\nfalse` or `sslmode=no-verify` seemingly has no effect on Deno.\n\nRef:\nhttps://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/TML-1482/support-self-signed-certificates-in-qpe-for-postgres",
