          "message": "chore(deps): update engines to 6.17.0-16.c0aafc03b8ef6cdced8654b9a817999e02457d6a (#28232)\n\nThe base branch for this PR is: main\nThis automatic PR updates the engines to version\n`6.17.0-16.c0aafc03b8ef6cdced8654b9a817999e02457d6a`.\nThis will get automatically merged if all the tests pass.\n:warning: If this PR needs to be updated, first remove the `automerge`\nlabel before pushing to avoid automerge to merge without waiting for\ntests.\n## Packages\n| Package | NPM URL |\n|---------|---------|\n|`@prisma/engines-version`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/engines-version/v/6.17.0-16.c0aafc03b8ef6cdced8654b9a817999e02457d6a|\n|`@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm/v/6.17.0-16.c0aafc03b8ef6cdced8654b9a817999e02457d6a|\n|`@prisma/query-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-engine-wasm/v/6.17.0-16.c0aafc03b8ef6cdced8654b9a817999e02457d6a|\n|`@prisma/query-compiler-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-compiler-wasm/v/6.17.0-16.c0aafc03b8ef6cdced8654b9a817999e02457d6a|\n|`@prisma/schema-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/schema-engine-wasm/v/6.17.0-16.c0aafc03b8ef6cdced8654b9a817999e02457d6a|\n## Engines commit\n\n[`prisma/prisma-engines@c0aafc03b8ef6cdced8654b9a817999e02457d6a`](https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/commit/c0aafc03b8ef6cdced8654b9a817999e02457d6a)\n\nCo-authored-by: Oleksii (Alexey) Orlenko <alex@aqrln.net>",
