          "id": "6e8d6fe3b6a7b37ce973ac8b576be3ac3657fdb9",
          "message": "ci: merge the release workflows (#28460)\n\nIt seems like my worry was correct and we have to have a single\ntop-level workflow for the OIDC publish to work, so I merged the three\nrelease files together.\n\nI didn't notice that it was broken because I mistakenly run the test\nwhile the NPM token was still being populated in CI. Now that the token\nis gone the publish job is failing on `main`. I've run an integration\npublish from this branch and it has worked:\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma/actions/runs/19141641946/job/54708053029.",
          "timestamp": "2025-11-07T10:44:13Z",
