          "message": "feat(cli): improve `prisma init` output (#28546)\n\n## Summary\n\nSimplify `prisma init` output as described in\nhttps://www.notion.so/prismaio/Refreshed-prisma-init-29a9e8aecef780e1838eff4627741d19?source=copy_link#29b9e8aecef780e3a989cf773f60b7ff.\n\n## Light theme\n\n### Without warnings\n<img width=\"862\" height=\"403\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83626ce0-20d8-4cc5-b4be-8f5f78b78c40\"\n/>\n\n### With warnings\n<img width=\"807\" height=\"412\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c40e595-cade-4859-ba92-37a9742bd856\"\n/>\n\n## Dark theme\n\n### Without warnings\n<img width=\"860\" height=\"400\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/268e8ef4-224a-40a2-a91a-14283a844346\"\n/>\n\n### With warnings\n<img width=\"813\" height=\"412\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4de4cd27-3881-49a3-87f1-c0b330906838\"\n/>\n\n### Alternative database type\n<img width=\"1067\" height=\"277\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0df093a-0b56-4c98-9fd4-5129710f66c5\"\n/>\n\n\n---\n\nCloses:\nhttps://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/TML-1551/update-prisma-init-to-produce-new-output",
