          "id": "177882704271b747b3618b0cf6790e46f2432b7a",
          "message": "feat(cli): update `prisma init --db` output (#28551)\n\nUpdate `prisma init --db` to output the direct connection string to the\ndatabase.\n\nSince there's no way to obtain a direct TCP URL in the legacy GraphQL\nPlatform API, this also updates `prisma init --db` to use the Management\nAPI instead. It also introduces a new OAuth login flow for the\nManagement API, so users won't be affected by the token expiration issue\nthat exists in the Platform CLI anymore.\n\nThe output of the command is updated to match\nhttps://www.notion.so/prismaio/Refreshed-prisma-init-29a9e8aecef780e1838eff4627741d19?source=copy_link#2a99e8aecef780759e8ec893017c7c2a\n\nCloses:\nhttps://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/TML-1593/update-prisma-init-db-to-print-direct-tcp-url\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Will Madden <w.a.madden@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Nurul Sundarani <nurulraza26@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Will Madden <madden@prisma.io>\nCo-authored-by: jkomyno <12381818+jkomyno@users.noreply.github.com>",
          "timestamp": "2025-11-19T15:09:28+04:00",
