          "id": "58fec5e43a794832bb4c5ec3f5f3f9513bbaa657",
          "message": "refactor: refactor schema path loading and fix config relative handling (#28734)\n\n[TML-1634](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/TML-1634/fix-the-default-schema-loading-location)\n\nRefactors the code so that instead of passing 3 parameters everywhere we\nnow pass a schema path that can only be one of the expected inputs:\n```\nexport type SchemaPathInput = { cliProvidedPath: string } | { configProvidedPath: string } | { rootDir: string }\n```\nI also created a convenience function `createSchemaPathInput` for\ncreating it.\n\nThis PR also fixes the default schema loading so that the schema is\nsearched relative to the config file if it exists and `cwd` otherwise\nand added tests for the affected commands.",
