          "id": "8bb6b7cafb4fb09e21d6085b8937885de047f233",
          "message": "feat: TML-1618 add ppg local vs remote tracking for studio cli (#28765)\n\nDetects whether studio connects to a local or remote ppg instance.\nPrimarily by URL but to detect a local ppg we cross check a provided\npostgres url with the list of known local ppg instances to see if the\nports match.\n\nThis information is then used in the telemetry data for studio. Tried to\nbe analogous to the studio tracking implementation in the VSCode\nExtension.",
