          "message": "chore(deps): update engines to 7.2.0-1.3f298657b368429158ee75de33d3dc7ca4b307a5 (#28844)\n\nThe base branch for this PR is: main\nThis automatic PR updates the engines to version\n`7.2.0-1.3f298657b368429158ee75de33d3dc7ca4b307a5`.\nThis will get automatically merged if all the tests pass.\n:warning: If this PR needs to be updated, first remove the `automerge`\nlabel before pushing to avoid automerge to merge without waiting for\ntests.\n## Packages\n| Package | NPM URL |\n|---------|---------|\n|`@prisma/engines-version`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/engines-version/v/7.2.0-1.3f298657b368429158ee75de33d3dc7ca4b307a5|\n|`@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm/v/7.2.0-1.3f298657b368429158ee75de33d3dc7ca4b307a5|\n|`@prisma/query-compiler-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-compiler-wasm/v/7.2.0-1.3f298657b368429158ee75de33d3dc7ca4b307a5|\n|`@prisma/schema-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/schema-engine-wasm/v/7.2.0-1.3f298657b368429158ee75de33d3dc7ca4b307a5|\n## Engines commit\n\n[`prisma/prisma-engines@3f298657b368429158ee75de33d3dc7ca4b307a5`](https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/commit/3f298657b368429158ee75de33d3dc7ca4b307a5)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n* Updated core dependencies across multiple packages to the latest\ncompatible versions for improved stability and reliability.\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review\nsettings.</sub>\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
