          "distinct": true,
          "id": "1677a32755578a85f7acaa2ae57cf11997872b41",
          "message": "docs: fix broken getting started links across repository (#28948)\n\nThe \"Getting Started\" links in packages/client/README.md,\npackages/cli/README.md, packages/migrate/README.md and the root\nREADME.md were returning 404 errors or legacy redirects due to the\nrecent documentation restructuring.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n* Updated README links across the project to point to new ORM-focused\nguides: Prisma ORM Quickstart (Prisma Postgres), ORM SQLite quickstart,\nPrisma Migrate getting-started, and the ORM-based \"Add Prisma to an\nexisting project\" guide — ensuring in-product docs and navigation\nreference current setup and quickstart resources.\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review\nsettings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
