          "message": "chore(deps): update engines to 7.4.0-5.f3eee967148e573af072a859822ac3bdd9145696 (#29102)\n\nThe base branch for this PR is: main\nThis automatic PR updates the engines to version\n`7.4.0-5.f3eee967148e573af072a859822ac3bdd9145696`.\nThis will get automatically merged if all the tests pass.\n:warning: If this PR needs to be updated, first remove the `automerge`\nlabel before pushing to avoid automerge to merge without waiting for\ntests.\n## Packages\n| Package | NPM URL |\n|---------|---------|\n|`@prisma/engines-version`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/engines-version/v/7.4.0-5.f3eee967148e573af072a859822ac3bdd9145696|\n|`@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm/v/7.4.0-5.f3eee967148e573af072a859822ac3bdd9145696|\n|`@prisma/query-compiler-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-compiler-wasm/v/7.4.0-5.f3eee967148e573af072a859822ac3bdd9145696|\n|`@prisma/schema-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/schema-engine-wasm/v/7.4.0-5.f3eee967148e573af072a859822ac3bdd9145696|\n## Engines commit\n\n[`prisma/prisma-engines@f3eee967148e573af072a859822ac3bdd9145696`](https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/commit/f3eee967148e573af072a859822ac3bdd9145696)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n* Bumped Prisma engines and related wasm/query-compiler packages to\nnewer 7.4.0-5.* revisions across client, generators, engines, migrate,\nfetch-engine, internals and schema loader packages to keep builds\naligned with upstream improvements.\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review\nsettings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
