          "id": "17e19752529763fe617fa0b5de17235282a8cbef",
          "message": "feat: PTL-956 remove platform CLI (#29186)\n\n## Summary\n\nRemoves the entire `prisma platform` CLI namespace, which provided\ncommands for managing Prisma Platform resources (workspaces, projects,\nenvironments, auth, Accelerate, Pulse, service tokens) directly from the\nCLI. These commands have been superseded by the [Prisma\nConsole](https://console.prisma.io) web UI and the management API.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **Deleted `packages/cli/src/platform/`** — Removed all platform\nsubcommands (`auth`, `workspace`, `project`, `environment`,\n`accelerate`, `pulse`, `serviceToken`) and their shared utilities\n(~2,500 lines).\n- **Removed `platform` registration from `bin.ts`** — The `prisma\nplatform` command tree (including the `apikey` alias for `serviceToken`)\nis no longer registered in the CLI.\n- **Relocated shared utilities still in use:**\n- `printPpgInitOutput` and `successMessage` moved from `platform/_` and\n`platform/_lib/messages` to a new `packages/cli/src/init/ppg-output.ts`\nmodule (used by `prisma init` for Prisma Postgres setup).\n- `createHelp` moved from `platform/_lib/help` to\n`packages/cli/src/utils/help.ts` (used by the MCP command). The\ninterface was also slightly updated to accept a `usageLine` parameter\ninstead of previously deriving it from the platform namespace context.\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nThe following CLI commands are removed:\n\n- `prisma platform auth login|logout|show`\n- `prisma platform workspace show`\n- `prisma platform project create|delete|show`\n- `prisma platform environment create|delete|show`\n- `prisma platform accelerate enable|disable`\n- `prisma platform pulse enable|disable`\n- `prisma platform serviceToken create|delete|show` (and `apikey` alias)\n\nUsers relying on these commands should use the [Prisma\nConsole](https://console.prisma.io) or the management API directly.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n## Release Notes\n\n* **Removals**\n* Removed the `prisma platform` subcommand and all associated features,\nincluding authentication, workspace, project, environment, accelerate,\npulse, and service token management from the CLI.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Reorganized help formatting utilities for improved code structure.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
