          "message": "doc: update PrismaClient ctor usages in docs (#29260)\n\n[TML-1957](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/TML-1957/fix-outdated-prisma-6-docs)\n\nUpdates the docs to make it clear we now require an `adapter`.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n* Updated PrismaClient instantiation examples to demonstrate\nadapter-based configuration.\n  * Added guidance on loading environment variables using various tools.\n* Refreshed code examples in documentation and generated templates to\nreflect current usage patterns.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
