          "message": "chore(deps): update engines to 7.5.0-15.280c870be64f457428992c43c1f6d557fab6e29e (#29334)\n\nThe base branch for this PR is: main\nThis automatic PR updates the engines to version\n`7.5.0-15.280c870be64f457428992c43c1f6d557fab6e29e`.\nThis will get automatically merged if all the tests pass.\n:warning: If this PR needs to be updated, first remove the `automerge`\nlabel before pushing to avoid automerge to merge without waiting for\ntests.\n## Packages\n| Package | NPM URL |\n|---------|---------|\n|`@prisma/engines-version`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/engines-version/v/7.5.0-15.280c870be64f457428992c43c1f6d557fab6e29e|\n|`@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/prisma-schema-wasm/v/7.5.0-15.280c870be64f457428992c43c1f6d557fab6e29e|\n|`@prisma/query-compiler-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/query-compiler-wasm/v/7.5.0-15.280c870be64f457428992c43c1f6d557fab6e29e|\n|`@prisma/schema-engine-wasm`|\nhttps://npmjs.com/package/@prisma/schema-engine-wasm/v/7.5.0-15.280c870be64f457428992c43c1f6d557fab6e29e|\n## Engines commit\n\n[`prisma/prisma-engines@280c870be64f457428992c43c1f6d557fab6e29e`](https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/commit/280c870be64f457428992c43c1f6d557fab6e29e)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n* Updated Prisma engine, schema loader, and related internal\ndependencies to the latest versions across all packages. These updates\nimprove overall system compatibility, incorporate upstream bug fixes and\nperformance improvements, enhance stability, and ensure all packages\nfunction optimally together.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\nCo-authored-by: jacek-prisma <malec@prisma.io>",
