          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4131568160a0efe49285991ced9bb2fa4133f50a",
          "message": "fix: set @types/pg to ^8.16.0 (#29390)\n\nSets the `@types/pg` to use a more relaxed constraint and a more recent\nversion `^8.16`. The hard constraint has caused issues described here\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/29356. I decided to bump it to\n`^8.16.0` to align it with our `pg` dependency. `8.16.0` is the only\n`@types/pg` available for `8.16` `pg` series. Reasoning is explained\nhere in more detail:\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma/pull/29357#discussion_r2983585611\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated PostgreSQL type definitions to a newer version\n* Improved TypeScript compatibility by removing outdated type\nsuppression comments\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
