          "id": "6a3c3ccf9cc2db7f27bbbf6df9f050fc112dc66e",
          "message": "chore: extract parameterization to client-engine-runtime (#29422)\n\nExtracts the parameterization logic into `client-engine-runtime` from\n`client`. The purpose is to make it more easily consumable from query\nengine tests. I've also extracted some DMMF logic into a new package\ncalled `get-dmmf`, the code was refactored to avoid using `fp-ts` and\nwritten with plain `try ... catch` instead.\n\nThis PR also has 2 small bug fixes for issues discovered in\n`prisma-engines` tests:\n-\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma/pull/29422/changes/003e602520d968f92b30b5ea8cdd4eef2d0fc921\n-\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma/pull/29422/changes/650a781a3be659f428d77fec0b3f4851810c02fc\n\nEngines PR: https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines/pull/5801\n\n\n[TML-2169](https://linear.app/prisma-company/issue/TML-2169/cover-parameterisation-in-the-prisma-engines-query-tests)",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-01T12:00:11+01:00",
