          "id": "572340698b1b81bbe22ef9793e72d13113c11d4c",
          "message": "fix(cli): route bootstrap telemetry to Prisma Web Properties project (#29473)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Routes bootstrap activation telemetry (`activation:*` events) to the\ncorrect PostHog project for console-related tracking.\n- Makes `PosthogEventCapture` accept an optional API key parameter,\ndefaulting to the existing key for backward compatibility.\n- NPS feedback events remain unaffected.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Verify bootstrap activation events appear in the target PostHog\nproject after running `prisma bootstrap`\n- [ ] Verify NPS feedback events are unaffected",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-20T16:48:47+02:00",
          "tree_id": "ee43823f085a536bdd9794438972d8d3d04a92a4",
