          "message": "fix: remove savepoint operations from the D1 adapter (#29499)\n\nAs stated here:\nhttps://github.com/prisma/prisma/blob/830f75cd99d13d575c046c66f2dad60c8c86a10a/packages/adapter-d1/src/d1-worker.ts#L195\nD1 transactional operations should be ignored. The same should apply to\nthe savenpoints.\n\nRelated issue: https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/29477",
