          "id": "cdca3335b392483aeb4ee5483cda436e4aaffb1a",
          "message": "chore(deps): update @prisma/dev to 0.24.14 (#29686)\n\nUpdates `@prisma/dev` in `packages/cli` from 0.24.9 to 0.24.14.\n\nThe lockfile changes beyond the version bump itself are transitive\ndependencies of `@prisma/dev`: `@prisma/streams-local` moves to 0.1.11,\nand the package's HTTP routing layer switches from `hono` to\n`find-my-way` (bringing in `fast-querystring`, `safe-regex2`, `ret`, and\n`fast-decode-uri-component`, and dropping `http-status-codes`).",
