          "distinct": true,
          "id": "eba51cae0fd565aa4353c06dabd51d47910143f5",
          "message": "feat(cli): show Prisma CLI path in version output (#29573)\n\n/claim #7771\nFixes #7771\n\n## Summary\n- Add the Prisma CLI package path to `prisma -v` / `prisma version`\noutput.\n- Resolve the path from the CLI package.json so the output points at the\ninstallation responsible for the running CLI.\n- Update the version command snapshot sanitization for the new path row.\n\n## Demo / Review Proof\n- Short demo video:\nhttps://github.com/SadmanPinon/bounty-proof-assets/blob/main/demos/prisma-7771-demo.mp4\n\n\n## Validation\n- corepack pnpm --filter \"prisma...\" build\n- corepack pnpm --filter prisma build\n- corepack pnpm --filter prisma test\nsrc/__tests__/commands/Version.test.ts\n- corepack pnpm exec eslint packages/cli/src/Version.ts\npackages/cli/src/__tests__/commands/Version.test.ts\n- corepack pnpm exec prettier --check packages/cli/src/Version.ts\npackages/cli/src/__tests__/commands/Version.test.ts\n- node packages/cli/build/index.js -v\n\nNote: local Node was v23.7.0, so pnpm printed the repo engine warning\n(`^20.19 || ^22.12 || >=24.0`), but the build and targeted test passed.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Oleksii Orlenko <alex@aqrln.net>",
