          "message": "chore(deps-dev): bump find-up from 7.0.0 to 8.0.0 (#29755)\n\nBumps [find-up](https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up) from 7.0.0 to\n8.0.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/releases\">find-up's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v8.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Breaking</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require Node.js 20  321107b</li>\n<li>Stop re-exporting <code>path-exists</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/issues/69\">#69</a>)\nd65d145\n<ul>\n<li>import it directly from its <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/path-exists\">package</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>{type: 'both'}</code> option to find files or directories\n67f453c</li>\n<li>Add <code>findDown</code> and <code>findDownSync</code> to search\ndescendant directories 8e02916</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/compare/v7.0.0...v8.0.0\">https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/compare/v7.0.0...v8.0.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/commit/5a009c227a484e503b78566412b1c0fd3dab3c27\"><code>5a009c2</code></a>\n8.0.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/commit/321107b098544bb559f8d283605cb1d574d1cb38\"><code>321107b</code></a>\nRequire Node.js 20</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/commit/67f453ce079826f67bdf3cf177ebde1759ad8a11\"><code>67f453c</code></a>\nAdd <code>type: 'both’</code> option to find files or directories</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/commit/8e0291692482706ebe0f858f5ed15fcbb2d9ecbf\"><code>8e02916</code></a>\nAdd <code>findDown</code> and <code>findDownSync</code> to search\ndescendant directories (breadth-f...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/commit/d65d145209df25cddf3c02679ab8b77eead62d0a\"><code>d65d145</code></a>\nStop re-exporting <code>path-exists</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/issues/69\">#69</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/commit/f9d7aafb15947e0eccf940247daaa04cf746f697\"><code>f9d7aaf</code></a>\nMeta tweak</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/commit/6076472b32ba30c07dde2a75c45972acd59bac7a\"><code>6076472</code></a>\nMinor tweak (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/issues/73\">#73</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/find-up/compare/v7.0.0...v8.0.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
