          "id": "bf5d5e776d8884ccf3efe4030b05226c02f721d4",
          "message": "feat(cli): warn on global local version mismatch (#29593)\n\n/claim #1911\nFixes #1911\n\n## Summary\n- warn during `prisma generate` when the current Prisma CLI is globally\ninstalled and differs from local installed `prisma` or `@prisma/client`\n- compare against package versions found in local `node_modules` rather\nthan package.json specifiers, so locked/workspace installs are not\nmisread\n- keep generation non-blocking; `--no-hints` still hides normal hints\nbut keeps this warning visible\n\n## Coverage\n- added unit coverage for non-global runs, missing packages, matching\nversions, single/both package mismatches, empty global version, and\nnode_modules resolution\n- added Generate coverage for `--no-hints` and non-`prisma-client-js`\ngenerator output\n\n## Validation\n- `corepack pnpm --filter prisma test\nsrc/__tests__/globalLocalVersionMismatch.test.ts`\n- `corepack pnpm --filter prisma test\nsrc/__tests__/commands/Generate.test.ts`\n- `corepack pnpm exec eslint packages/cli/src/Generate.ts\npackages/cli/src/utils/globalLocalVersionMismatch.ts\npackages/cli/src/__tests__/globalLocalVersionMismatch.test.ts\npackages/cli/src/__tests__/commands/Generate.test.ts`\n- `corepack pnpm exec prettier --check packages/cli/src/Generate.ts\npackages/cli/src/utils/globalLocalVersionMismatch.ts\npackages/cli/src/__tests__/globalLocalVersionMismatch.test.ts\npackages/cli/src/__tests__/commands/Generate.test.ts`\n- `corepack pnpm --filter prisma build`\n\nAlgora payout: @jamilahmadzai via Algora platform.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alexey Orlenko's AI Agent <robot@aqrln.net>",
